%5B%7B%22title%22%3A%22Centre%20may%20table%20bill%20to%20make%20deepfakes%2C%20digital%20arrest%20separate%20offences%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785282121000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.toiimg.com%2Fphoto%2Fmsid-132696725%2Cimgsize-78648.cms%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Findia%2Fcentre-may-table-bill-to-make-deepfakes-digital-arrest-separate-offences%2Farticleshow%2F132694735.cms%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22The%20government%20plans%20to%20introduce%20a%20bill%20addressing%20digital%20arrests%20and%20AI%20deepfakes.%20Existing%20laws%20do%20not%20define%20these%20emerging%20digital%20crimes%20effectively.%20The%20Supreme%20Court%20urged%20the%20government%20to%20create%20specific%20offenses%20for%20these%20issues.%20This%20new%20legislation%20will%20categorize%20digital%20arrest%20and%20deepfakes%20as%20distinct%20offenses.%20Consequential%20punishments%20and%20asset%20freezing%20measures%20will%20be%20included%20in%20the%20proposed%20law.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22DHANANJAY%20MAHAPATRA%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22ServiceNow%20cut%20hundreds%20of%20jobs%20to%20streamline%20operations.%20One%20staffer%20called%20it%20a%20'very%20tough%20day.'%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Bill%20McDermott%2C%20chief%20executive%20officer%20of%20ServiceNow%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a691816ce52cb26b8394eba%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222667%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EBill%20McDermott%2C%20chief%20executive%20of%20ServiceNow%3Cp%3EBloomberg%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EServiceNow%20cuts%20jobs%2C%20reflecting%20broader%20challenges%20in%20the%20software%20sector.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ECEO%20Bill%20McDermott%20has%20urged%20staff%20to%20make%20workflows%20more%20efficient%20as%20a%20model%20for%20customers.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EServiceNow%20has%20made%20several%20large%20acquisitions%20this%20year.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fservicenow-q2-2026-earnings-counter-ai-threat-narrative-strong-growth-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EServiceNow%3C%2Fa%3E%20has%20been%20cutting%20several%20hundred%20jobs%20as%20part%20of%20a%20global%20restructuring%2C%20the%20latest%20sign%20of%20pressure%20on%20the%20software%20industry.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20ServiceNow%20spokesperson%20said%20a%20%26quot%3Blow%20single-digit%26quot%3B%20percentage%20of%20the%20company's%20total%20head%20count%20has%20been%20affected%20by%20the%20cuts%2C%20which%20have%20happened%20over%20several%20months%20this%20year.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EServiceNow%20ended%202025%20with%2029%2C187%20employees%2C%20so%20the%20cuts%20likely%20total%20several%20hundred%20jobs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECEO%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fservicenow-ceo-dismisses-ai-threats-parlor-tricks-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EBill%20McDermott%3C%2Fa%3E%20said%20at%20the%20start%20of%20this%20year%20that%20ServiceNow%20would%20end%202026%20with%20the%20same%20head%20count%20as%20it%20started%20the%20year%20with.%20He's%20also%20been%20pushing%20staff%20to%20reorganize%20their%20workflows%20to%20embrace%20new%20technology%20and%20be%20an%20example%20to%20ServiceNow%20customers%20on%20how%20to%20become%20more%20efficient.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EServiceNow%20has%20also%20made%20some%20big%20acquisitions%20in%20the%20past%20year%2C%20such%20as%20Armis%20and%20Veza%2C%20so%20the%20company%20is%20likely%20streamlining%20operations%20from%20integrating%20these%20new%20businesses.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20ServiceNow%20employee%20told%20Business%20Insider%20on%20Tuesday%20the%20cuts%20were%20described%20internally%20as%20a%20global%20restructuring%20and%20said%20it%20had%20been%20a%20%26quot%3Bvery%20tough%20day.%26quot%3B%20This%20person%20asked%20not%20to%20be%20identified%20discussing%20sensitive%20matters.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EInvestors%20have%20hammered%20some%20software%20stocks%20in%20the%20past%20year%20on%20concerns%20that%20AI%20will%20disrupt%20the%20sector%20by%20reducing%20demand%20and%20making%20it%20easier%20for%20companies%20to%20develop%20their%20own%20software%20tools.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EServiceNow%2C%20like%20many%20enterprise%20software%20companies%2C%20is%20investing%20heavily%20in%20AI%20while%20reshaping%20parts%20of%20its%20business.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELast%20week%2C%20ServiceNow%20reported%20quarterly%20results%20that%20met%20or%20exceeded%20Wall%20Street%20expectations%20and%20raised%20its%20full-year%20subscription%20revenue%20guidance%2C%20even%20as%20investors%20continue%20to%20debate%20how%20AI%20will%20reshape%20the%20software%20industry.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3E%3Cem%3ESign%20up%20for%20BI's%20Tech%20Memo%20newsletter%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsubscription%2Fnewsletter%2Ftech-memo%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ehere%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cstrong%3E%3Cem%3E.%20Reach%20out%20to%20me%20via%20email%20at%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22mailto%3Aabarr%40businessinsider.com%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eabarr%40businessinsider.com%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cstrong%3E%3Cem%3E.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fservicenow-cuts-jobs-amid-global-restructuring-and-ai-focus-2026-7%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785282120000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a691816ce52cb26b8394eba%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fservicenow-cuts-jobs-amid-global-restructuring-and-ai-focus-2026-7%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Amid%20industry%20pressure%2C%20ServiceNow%2C%20overseen%20by%20CEO%20Bill%20McDermott%2C%20reduces%20workforce%20while%20focusi