222500%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Anthropic%20cofounder%20Jack%20Clark%20speaks%20during%20an%20event%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a69137e548c9c486b3118c7%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221667%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EAnthropic%20cofounder%20Jack%20Clark%20was%20one%20of%20the%20biggest%20names%20to%20sign%20onto%20an%20open%20letter%20calling%20for%20the%20US%20to%20develop%20AI%20regulations.%3Cp%3EBrendan%20Smialowski%2FAFP%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EAn%20open%20letter%20signed%20by%20top%20officials%20at%20Anthropic%2C%20OpenAI%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmeta%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22false%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EMeta%2C%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20Google%20calls%20for%20AI%20regulations.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ESpecifically%2C%20the%20letter%20wants%20the%20US%20government%20to%20support%20international%20governance%20tools.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThese%20tools%20could%20slow%20the%20pace%20of%20some%20AI%20development.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3ESenior%20officials%20at%20some%20of%20the%20nation's%20leading%20AI%20companies%20say%20it's%20time%20for%20the%20federal%20government%20to%20find%20a%20way%20to%20put%20the%20brakes%20on%20AI%20development%20if%20it's%20needed.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20request%20that%20the%20U.S.%20government%20support%20an%20international%20effort%20to%20develop%20the%20technical%20and%20governance%20tools%20needed%20to%20deliberately%20pace%20the%20frontier%20of%20automated%20AI%20development%2C%26quot%3B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.pacingthefrontier.com%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%20reads%20an%20open%20letter%20%3C%2Fa%3Esigned%20by%20more%20than%201%2C100%20AI%20workers%20from%20companies%20including%20OpenAI%2C%20Anthropic%2C%20Google%2C%20and%20Meta.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20signatories%20include%20two%20Anthropic%20cofounders%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fjack-clark-anthropic-college-degrees-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EJack%20Clark%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20Jared%20Kaplan%3B%20OpenAI's%20chief%20scientist%20Jakub%20Pachocki%3B%20Meta's%20chief%20scientist%20Shengjia%20Zhao%3B%20and%20Anca%20Dragan%2C%20who%20leads%20AI%20safety%20and%20alignment%20at%20Google%20DeepMind.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20letter%20zeroes%20in%20on%20%26quot%3Bautomated%20AI%20development%2C%26quot%3B%20which%20refers%20to%20when%20AI%20will%20be%20capable%20of%20developing%20itself%2C%20something%20the%20industry%20calls%20%26quot%3BRecursive%20Self-Improvement.%26quot%3B%20Anthropic%20has%20shared%20that%20its%20Claude%20models%20are%20quickly%20approaching%20that%20threshold.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt%20is%20hard%20to%20predict%20exactly%20how%20much%20this%20will%20accelerate%20AI%20progress%2C%20but%20there%20is%20a%20real%20risk%20that%20capability%20development%20rapidly%20accelerates%20beyond%20our%20ability%20to%20understand%20or%20control%20the%20resulting%20systems%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20letter%20says%20of%20that%20potential%20moment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EJohn%20Schulman%2C%20chief%20scientist%20at%20Thinking%20Machines%2C%20a%20startup%20founded%20by%20former%20OpenAI%20chief%20technical%20officer%20Mira%20Murati%2C%20said%20he%20signed%20on%20to%20draw%20attention%20to%20the%20topic.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BSigned%20because%20this%20statement%20helps%20establish%20common%20knowledge%20about%20the%20possible%20need%20for%20coordination%20mechanisms%20as%20automated%20AI%20research%20accelerates%20progress%2C%26quot%3B%20Schulman%20wrote%20in%20a%20quote%20shared%20by%20the%20letter's%20organizers%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20added%2C%20%26quot%3BI'd%20also%20like%20to%20see%20labs%20start%20designing%20these%20mechanisms%20voluntarily%2C%20even%20before%20the%20USG%20gets%20involved%2C%26quot%3B%20using%20an%20abbreviation%20for%20the%20US%20government.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20letter%20shows%20how%20many%20in%20the%20industry%20are%20coalescing%20around%20a%20call%20for%20regulation.%20In%20recent%20weeks%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdario-amodei%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAnthropic%20CEO%20Dario%20Amodei%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20OpenAI%20CEO%20Sam%20Altman%2C%20and%20Google%20DeepMind%20head%20Demis%20Hassabis%20have%20all%20outlined%20various%20frameworks%20for%20some%20sort%20of%20global%20AI%20regulation.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20conversation%20about%20AI%20regulation%20is%20reaching%20critical%20mass%20after%20one%20of%20OpenAI's%20models%20breached%20its%20sandbox%20and%20hacked%20into%20the%20open-source%20platform%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsam-altman-ai-power-diffused-security-breach-hugging-face-hack-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EHugging%20Face%3C%2Fa%3E's%20systems%2C%20an%20episode%20that%20Altman%20has%20called%20%26quot%3Ba%20real%20reminder%20of%20the%20stakes%20of%20what's%20happening.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Trump%20administration%20has%20so%20far%20favored%20a%20light%20touch%20on%20regulation%2C%20but%20that%20has%20become%20increasingly%20embattled%20as%20frontier%20AI%20models%20spook%20government%20and%20corporate%20officials%20over%20their%20sheer%20power.%20The%20White%20House%20moved%20to%20implement%20export%20controls%20to%20briefly%20curtail%20Anthropic's%20release%20of%20Fable%205%2C%20its%20most%20powerful%20publicly%20available%20model%2C%20and%20later%20asked%20OpenAI%20to%20delay%20the%20release%20of%20GPT-5.6%2C%20its%20latest%20frontier%20model.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdonald-trump%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EPresident%20Donald%20Trump%3C%2Fa%3E%20has%20previously%20said%20that%20overly%20burdensome%20regulations%20would%20harm%20the%20US%20in%20its%20race%20against%20China-based%20AI%20companies.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDespite%20broad%20agreement%20that%20something%20must%20be%20done%2C%20Congress%20has%20failed%20to%20develop%20a%20policy%20that%20can%20pass%20both%20houses%20and%20reach%20Trump's%20desk.%20In%20the%20meantime%2C%20states%20have%20imposed%20their%20own%20industry%20regulations.%20Most%20notably%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnew-york-state-ai-data-center-moratorium-temporary-ban-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ENew%20York%20has%20imposed%20a%20one-year%20statewide%20moratorium%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20the%20construction%20of%20the%20new%20mega%20data%20centers%20that%20AI%20companies%20and%20hyperscalers%20are%20hoping%20to%20build.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BEach%20company%E2%80%94and%20country%E2%80%94is%20under%20intense%20competitive%20pressure%20not%20to%20unilaterally%20slow%20that%20acceleration%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20letter%20reads.%20%26quot%3BAnd%20today%2C%20the%20world%20lacks%20the%20technical%20and%20governance%20tools%20to%20deliberately%20pace%20frontier-wide%20progress.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20the%20industry%20seems%20to%20agree%20on%20the%20concept%20of%20regulation%2C%20the%20exact%20details%20can%20vary.%20Amodei%20has%20called%20for%20an%20independent%20agency%20akin%20to%20the%20Federal%20Aviation%20Administration%20that%20would%20test%20frontier%20AI%20models%20and%2C%20if%20red%20flags%20are%20raised%2C%20have%20the%20power%20to%20halt%20their%20release.%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgoogle-deepmind-ceo-demis-hassabis-agi-safety-standards-body-gemini-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EHassabis'%20proposal%3C%2Fa%3E%20calls%20for%20an%20organization%20that%20would%20initially%20require%20only%20frontier%20companies%20to%20voluntarily%20share%20their%20models%20for%20review%20up%20to%2030%20days%20before%20release%2C%20but%20later%2C%20a%20mandatory%20pre-clearance%20would%20be%20required.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20letter%2C%20which%20was%20first%20reported%20on%20by%20Bloomberg%20before%20its%20release%2C%20was%20organized%20alongside%20two%20nonprofits%2C%20Guidelight%20AI%20Standards%20and%20Encode%20AI%2C%20both%20of%20which%20have%20promoted%20AI%20safety%20standards.%20Encode%20AI%20has%20previously%20clashed%20with%20OpenAI.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-open-letter-automated-development-2026-7%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785274019000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a69137e548c9c486b3118c7%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-open-letter-automated-development-2026-7%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22The%20letter%20zeroes%20in%20on%20concerns%20that%20frontier%20AI%20models%20may%20soon%20be%20able%20to%20improve%20themselves%2C%20which%20could%20drastically%20change%20the%20future%20of%20AI.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22bgriffiths%40insider.com%20(Brent%20D.%20Griffiths)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A99%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22The%20Trump%20administration%20has%20banned%20imports%20of%20new%20Chinese%20humanoid%20robots%20and%20power%20inverters%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22GUANGZHOU%2C%20CHINA%20-%20JULY%2027%3A%20An%20AgiBot%20intelligent%20robot%20works%20at%20a%20metro%20station%20to%20serve%20passengers%20on%20July%2027%2C%202026%20in%20Guangzhou%2C%20Guangdong%20Province%20of%20China.%20(Photo%20by%20VCG%2FVCG%20via%20Getty%20Images)%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6910fdce52cb26b8394e5e%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Trump%20administration%20announced%20new%20restrictions%20on%20Chinese%20tech%20imports%2C%20including%20robots%2C%20in%20a%20bid%20to%20defend%20domestic%20AI%20supply%20chains.%3Cp%3EVCG%2FVCG%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3ETrump%20imposed%20new%20restrictions%20on%20Chinese%20tech%20imports%20in%20a%20bid%20to%20defend%20domestic%20AI%20supply%20chains.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20new%20import%20ban%20targets%20Chinese%20humanoid%20robots%20and%20power%20inverters%20used%20for%20data%20centers.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20ban%20was%20introduced%20after%20the%20White%20House%20convened%20an%20interagency%20national%20security%20panel.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Trump%20administration%20is%20expanding%20its%20tech%20crackdown%20on%20China.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Federal%20Communications%20Commission%20announced%20new%20restrictions%20on%20Tuesday%20targeting%20imports%20of%20advanced%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhumanoid-robotics-stocks-etfs-how-to-invest-koid-labor-manufacturing-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EChinese%20robots%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20power%20inverters%2C%20as%20part%20of%20a%20broader%20push%20to%20secure%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fkevin-oleary-china-fear-north-america-work-together-canada-mexico-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Edomestic%20AI%20supply%20chain%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAccording%20to%20the%20FCC%2C%20the%20measure%20would%20ban%20imports%20of%20new%20Chinese-made%20humanoid%20and%20quadruped%20robots%2C%20as%20well%20as%20connected%20power%20inverters%20used%20in%20renewable%20energy%20systems%2C%20batteries%2C%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-china-data-centers-influence-campaign-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Edata%20centers%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20FCC%20wrote%20in%20a%20public%20statement%20that%20these%20moves%20are%20the%20result%20of%20an%20interagency%20national%20security%20panel%20assembled%20by%20the%20White%20House%2C%20which%20convened%20to%20make%20two%20National%20Security%20Determinations.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BInverters'%20remote%20connectivity%20introduces%20additional%20vulnerabilities%20which%20compound%20as%20inverter-based%20resources%20proliferate%20on%20the%20U.S.%20grid%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20panel%20wrote%20in%20the%20National%20Security%20Determinations.%20%26quot%3BThese%20vulnerabilities%20could%20enable%20foreign%20firms%20to%20turn%20off%20the%20inverters%20or%20use%20them%20to%20collect%20and%20exfiltrate%20data.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BAdvanced%20robotic%20devices%20collect%20data%20that%20could%20be%20leveraged%20by%20malign%20actors%20to%20surveil%20Americans%2C%20enhance%20the%20capabilities%20of%20foreign%20intelligence%20services%2C%20or%20to%20remotely%20commandeer%20the%20robots%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20panel%20added.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EJohn%20Moolenaar%2C%20Republican%20chairman%20of%20the%20House%20Select%20Committee%20on%20China%2C%20applauded%20the%20FCC's%20move%20and%20urged%20Congress%20to%20further%20the%20policy%20and%20codify%20it%20into%20a%20federal%20law.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt%20is%20likely%20that%20one%20day%20robotic%20technology%20will%20be%20in%20Americans'%20homes%20and%20workplaces%2C%20and%20we%20must%20protect%20our%20country%20by%20keeping%20out%20Chinese%20robots%20with%20backdoors%20that%20share%20sensitive%20data%20with%20the%20CCP%2C%26quot%3B%20Moolenaar%20said%20in%20a%20statement.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Chinese%20embassy%20in%20Washington%20did%20not%20immediately%20respond%20to%20a%20request%20for%20comment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftrump-expands-tech-crackdown-on-china-imports-to-humanoid-robots-2026-7%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785273932000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6910fdce52cb26b8394e5e%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftrump-expands-tech-crackdown-on-china-imports-to-humanoid-robots-2026-7%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Trump%20banned%20new%20imports%20of%20Chinese%20humanoid%20robots%20and%20power%20inverters%20used%20in%20data%20centers%20to%20protect%20the%20domestic%20AI%20suppl