20Boeing%20777%20that's%20outfitted%20with%20features%20to%20keep%20its%20crew%20rested%20over%20long-distance%20flights.%3Cp%3EPete%20Syme%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EA%20DHL%20cargo%20plane%20was%20on%20display%20at%20the%20Farnborough%20Airshow%20in%20the%20UK.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EWe%20got%20a%20tour%20from%20an%20executive%20in%20charge%20of%20managing%20DHL's%20fleet.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20crew's%20bunk%20beds%20looked%20cramped%2C%20but%20there%20were%20reclining%20seats%2C%20too.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3ECargo%20flights%20often%20operate%20throughout%20the%20night%20%E2%80%94%20and%20pilots%20need%20a%20place%20to%20sleep.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBusiness%20Insider%20got%20a%20look%20at%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fphotos-compare-secret-airplane-rooms-pilots-flight-attendants-sleep-2022-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ecrew%20rest%20area%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20other%20features%20on%20a%20DHL%20Boeing%20777%20freighter%20at%20the%20UK's%20Farnborough%20Airshow%20last%20week.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20bunk%20beds%20and%20rest%20area%20provide%20the%20pilots%20with%20the%20features%20they%20need%20to%20stay%20sharp%20on%20long-haul%20flights%20as%20they%20alternate%20shifts%20in%20the%20cockpit.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fboeing-777-history-2017-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EBoeing%20777-200LR%3C%2Fa%3E%20was%20originally%20a%20passenger%20jet%20flying%20long-haul%20with%20Delta%20Air%20Lines%20until%20the%20airline%20sold%20it%20during%20the%20COVID-19%20pandemic.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThen%2C%20it%20was%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-passenger-airliners-are-converted-into-freighter-planes-2021-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Econverted%20into%20a%20cargo%20plane%3C%2Fa%3E%20by%20the%20American%20company%20Mammoth%20Freighters.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBusiness%20Insider%20got%20a%20tour%20on%20board%20with%20DHL's%20senior%20vice%20president%20for%20global%20air%20fleet%20management%2C%20Malcolm%20Macbeth.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20was%20fascinating%20to%20see%20what%20life%20is%20like%20on%20board%20for%20the%20pilots%20who%20transport%20everything%20from%20small%20packages%20to%20semiconductors%20and%20live%20animals.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThis%20DHL%20cargo%20plane%20was%20at%20the%20center%20of%20the%20aircraft%20display%20at%20Farnborough%20Airshow.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225712%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20side%20view%20of%20a%20DHL%20Boeing%20777%20on%20display%20at%20the%202026%20Farnborough%20Airshow%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a68818154f987526177a65c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EPete%20Syme%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20Delta%20retired%20the%20plane%2C%20it%20spent%20six%20years%20out%20of%20service%20before%20being%20converted.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThis%20plane%20was%20basically%20not%20flying%20for%20six%20years%2C%20and%20now%20it's%20about%20to%20get%20flying%20again%2C%26quot%3B%20Macbeth%20told%20Business%20Insider.%20%26quot%3BSo%2C%20it's%20a%2016-year-old%20airplane%2C%20but%20is%20only%20actually%20closer%20to%2010.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EAll%20the%20passenger%20interior%20was%20stripped%20out%2C%20and%20the%20floor%20beams%20were%20replaced%20with%20stronger%20metal%20ones.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225491%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20interior%20cargo%20hold%20of%20a%20DHL%20Boeing%20777%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a688181ce52cb26b83948f7%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224118%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EPete%20Syme%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20typically%20much%20cheaper%20to%20convert%20an%20airliner%20into%20a%20freighter%20than%20to%20buy%20a%20new%20plane.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20airplane%20can%20carry%20a%20payload%20of%20up%20to%20102%20tons.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EUp%20front%2C%20much%20of%20the%20galley%20has%20been%20transformed%20into%20a%20crew%20rest%20area.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223435%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20wide%20shot%20of%20the%20front%20crew%20area%20on%20a%20DHL%20Boeing%20777%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a68842dce52cb26b8394906%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222577%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EPete%20Syme%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20part%20of%20a%20cargo%20plane%20is%20called%20the%20supernumerary%20area.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPilots%20and%20mechanics%20get%20top%20priority%20as%20they%20may%20need%20to%20be%20repositioned%20for%20work%2C%20although%20all%20DHL%20staff%20can%20go%20on%20board%20for%20business%20trips.%20DHL%2C%20a%20multinational%20package%20delivery%20corporation%20headquartered%20in%20Germany%2C%20has%20a%20fleet%20of%20over%20200%20planes.%20That%20includes%2035%20regular%20Boeing%20777F%20aircraft.%20It%20has%2013%20converted%20777s%20on%20order%20from%20Mammoth.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20joke%20that%20there%20are%20all%20these%20guys%20going%20around%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fprivate-jets-billionaire-status-symbol-luxury-time-food-perks-savings-2025-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eprivate%20jets%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20well%2C%20we've%20got%20the%20biggest%20private%20jet%20of%20anybody%2C%26quot%3B%20Macbeth%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EAbove%20the%20four%20seats%20are%20cupboards%20for%20storing%20belongings.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20wide%20view%20of%20four%20chairs%20and%20storage%20bins%20at%20the%20front%20of%20a%20DHL%20Boeing%20777%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6881b954f987526177a65e%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EPete%20Syme%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EUnderneath%20those%20are%20chargers%20for%20the%20passengers%2C%20too.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMacbeth%20said%20he%20sometimes%20flies%20on%20DHL%20planes%20from%20the%20company's%20British%20hub%20at%20East%20Midlands%20Airport%20to%20the%20US%20base%20in%20Cincinnati%2C%20rather%20than%20spending%20thousands%20of%20pounds%20on%20a%20British%20Airways%20flight%20from%20London%20Heathrow.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThe%20seats%20include%20leg%20rests%20and%20can%20recline%20up%20to%2045%20degrees.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225712%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Four%20seats%2C%20one%20of%20which%20is%20reclined%2C%20on%20board%20a%20DHL%20Boeing%20777%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6881b954f987526177a65f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EPete%20Syme%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20got%20to%20try%20it%20out%2C%20and%20while%20it%20wasn't%20quite%20as%20good%20as%20a%20lie-flat%20business%20class%20seat%2C%20it%20was%20definitely%20comfy%20and%20at%20least%20as%20good%20as%20premium%20economy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EOpposite%20is%20a%20small%20kitchen%20area%20for%20the%20crew%20and%20any%20passengers%20to%20prep%20their%20own%20meals.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20galley%20on%20a%20DHL%20Boeing%20777%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6881b9548c9c486b311324%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EPete%20Syme%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EYou%20might%20not%20get%20the%20same%20catering%20standard%20as%20a%20passenger%20airline%2C%20but%20there's%20enough%20to%20get%20by%20for%20hourslong%20flights.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EAnd%20to%20the%20side%2C%20a%20door%20opens