or%20modification%20training.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAdditionally%2C%20scientific%20evidence%20on%20how%20well%20calming%20vests%20actually%20work%20is%20limited%2C%20says%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.vet.cornell.edu%2Fabout-us%2Fpeople%2Fkatherine-anderson-dvm-dacvb%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EDr.%20Kate%20Anderson%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20a%20board-certified%20veterinary%20behaviorist%20and%20assistant%20clinical%20professor%20at%20the%20Duffield%20Institute%20for%20Animal%20Behavior%20at%20the%20Cornell%20University%20College%20of%20Veterinary%20Medicine.%20Referencing%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.mdpi.com%2F2076-2615%2F14%2F23%2F3445%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Erecent%20review%20in%20the%20scientific%20journal%20Animals%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20Anderson%20adds%20that%20the%20benefits%20of%20these%20vests%20are%20often%20anecdotal%20and%20affected%20by%20owner%20bias.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStill%2C%20the%20same%20review%20didn't%20identify%20any%20adverse%20side%20effects%20associated%20with%20calming%20vests.%20So%20as%20long%20as%20you're%20not%20dealing%20with%20an%20extreme%20case%20of%20anxiety%2C%20there's%20little%20risk%20in%20trying%20it%20out%20for%20yourself%20to%20see%20if%20it%20could%20provide%20your%20dog%20some%20relief.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22efe5f5f7-3143-4274-8914-0eb1c8fe44e3%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22How%20we%20tested%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EHow%20we%20tested%20dog%20anxiety%20vests%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221024%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20tan%20dog%20wearing%20a%20thundershirt%20calming%20wrap%20is%20shown%20up%20close%2C%20sleeping%20with%20her%20mouth%20partly%20open.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a69104ece52cb26b8394e58%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22768%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EWe%20tested%205%20different%20calming%20vests%2C%20including%20the%20ThunderShirt%20that%20Roo%20wears%20while%20napping%20here.%3Cp%3EElizabeth%20Holbrook%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20dog%20Roo%20is%20a%205-year-old%20rescue%20who%20is%20reactive%20and%20easily%20triggered.%20After%20developing%20a%20noise%20sensitivity%20to%20the%20back%20door%20and%20windows%20popping%2C%20she%20became%20even%20more%20on%20edge%20in%20the%20house.%20She%20had%20a%20hard%20time%20settling%2C%20even%20after%20all%20her%20mental%20and%20physical%20needs%20had%20been%20met.%20And%20once%20she%20had%20finally%20relaxed%2C%20if%20she%20heard%20the%20noise%20from%20the%20windows%20or%20door%2C%20she'd%20easily%20spook%20and%20pop%20back%20up%20and%20pace%2C%20whine%2C%20and%20pant.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20first%20took%20Roo%20to%20our%20vet%20to%20rule%20out%20any%20underlying%20medical%20issues%20and%20discovered%20she%20had%20a%20double%20ear%20infection.%20While%20this%20likely%20contributed%20to%20her%20sudden%20noise%20sensitivity%2C%20the%20behavior%20remained%20even%20after%20the%20infection%20had%20cleared.%20Since%20I%20was%20having%20trouble%20getting%20Roo's%20baseline%20back%20to%20a%20level%20where%20we%20could%20work%20on%20behavior-modification%20training%20and%20have%20her%20calm%20down%20enough%20to%20take%20treats%20again%2C%20I%20was%20curious%20whether%20a%20calming%20vest%20would%20help.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20trying%20out%20each%20anxiety%20vest%2C%20I%20evaluated%20the%20following%20points.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EFit%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20To%20verify%20accuracy%2C%20I%20compared%20the%20advertised%20size%20of%20the%20dog%20calming%20vest%20with%20how%20well%20it%20actually%20fit%20Roo's%20measurements%2C%20as%20a%20medium-sized%2C%2043-pound%20dog%20with%20a%20stocky%20chest.%20In%20particular%2C%20I%20inspected%20the%20snugness%20of%20each%20vest%2C%20confirming%20it%20was%20taut%20enough%20to%20maintain%20pressure%20without%20squeezing%20too%20tightly%2C%20especially%20around%20Roo's%20broader%20chest.%20I%20then%20checked%20to%20see%20if%20it%20was%20too%20heavy%2C%20uncomfortable%2C%20or%20restricted%20movement%20by%20observing%20Roo%20as%20she%20walked%20across%20the%20room%2C%20jumped%20on%20and%20off%20the%20bed%2C%20and%20went%20up%20and%20down%20the%20stairs.%20I%20also%20made%20sure%20the%20material%20was%20breathable%20and%20monitored%20Roo%20to%20see%20if%20she%20panted%20while%20wearing%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EEase%20of%20use%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EAs%20I%20put%20the%20vest%20on%20Roo%2C%20I%20closely%20watched%20her%20to%20see%20if%20she%20showed%20any%20hesitation%20or%20discomfort.%20I%20also%20noted%20whether%20the%20design%20was%20hard%20to%20figure%20out%20and%20how%20long%20it%20took%20me%20to%20put%20it%20on%20her.%20I%20then%20examined%20the%20adjustment%20points%20and%20whether%20they%20would%20provide%20enough%20room%20to%20accommodate%20different%20body%20shapes.%20I%20also%20noted%20whether%20the%20vest%20required%20putting%20it%20on%20over%20the%20head%2C%20which%20many%20dogs%20dislike.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EEffectiveness%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3ETo%20determine%20whether%20the%20vests%20helped%20reduce%20Roo's%20noise%20anxiety%2C%20I%20ran%20two%20tests%20for%20each.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20the%20first%20test%2C%20I%20put%20the%20vest%20on%20Roo%20after%20we'd%20come%20inside%20after%20our%20morning%20walk%20and%20had%20her%20wear%20it%20for%20an%20hour.%20At%20that%20point%2C%20all%20her%20needs%20had%20been%20met.%20She'd%20eaten%20breakfast%2C%20gone%20potty%2C%20and%20had%20a%20long%2C%20enriching%20sniffy%20walk%20often%20accompanied%20by%20training.%20I%20wanted%20to%20see%20if%20wearing%20the%20vest%20after%20we%20came%20inside%20helped%20her%20settle%20as%20she%20used%20to%20before%20she%20developed%20her%20noise%20phobia%20of%20the%20house%20sounds.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20the%20second%20test%2C%20I%20put%20the%20vest%20on%20Roo%20after%20she%20started%20showing%20signs%20of%20anxiety%20after%20hearing%20the%20house%20noises%2C%20and%20observed%20whether%20it%20made%20any%20noticeable%20difference%20in%20calming%