adapooch.com%2Fcollections%2Fdog-calming%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EWeighted%20Calming%20Collection%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20Canada%20Pooch%20consulted%20with%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fvcacanada.com%2Favse%2Fteam%2Fcolleen-wilson%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EDr.%20Colleen%20Wilson%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20a%20board-certified%20veterinary%20behaviorist%20in%20Eastern%20Ontario%20with%20over%2025%20years%20of%20experience%20in%20veterinary%20practice.%20With%20her%20input%2C%20it%20was%20determined%20that%20each%20size%20would%20not%20exceed%203%25%20of%20a%20dog's%20body%20weight%20to%20help%20ensure%20the%20safety%20of%20each%20pet%20and%20that%20the%20pressure%20is%20evenly%20distributed.%20In%20our%20testing%2C%20Roo%20didn't%20show%20signs%20of%20discomfort%20and%20moved%20around%20in%20the%20vest%20normally.%20I%20also%20found%20that%20it%20helped%20her%20relax%20after%20our%20morning%20walk%2C%20rather%20than%20anxiously%20following%20me%20around.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221920%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20tan%20dog%20models%20a%20light%20gray%20Canada%20Pooch%20calming%20vest%2C%20shown%20in%20both%20a%20side%20profile%20and%20a%20front-facing%20view%20highlighting%20the%20vest's%20snug%2C%20wraparound%20fit.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6903ad54f987526177ab75%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221440%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EElizabeth%20Holbrook%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EMade%20of%20polyester%2C%20rayon%2C%20and%20spandex%2C%20the%20jersey%20material%20is%20thick%20but%20breathable.%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20We%20tested%20it%20on%20both%20cooler%20and%20warmer%20days%20here%20in%20the%20Pacific%20Northwest.%20Roo%20didn't%20pant%20or%20show%20signs%20of%20being%20uncomfortably%20hot%20while%20wearing%20it.%20I%20did%20wonder%2C%20though%2C%20if%20she%20was%20running%20a%20bit%20warm%20with%20her%20double%20coat%20since%20she%20kept%20moving%20to%20various%20areas%20of%20the%20room%3A%20first%20in%20front%20of%20the%20fan%2C%20then%20on%20the%20bed%2C%20then%20back%20on%20the%20cool%20floor.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EThe%20cost%20is%20quite%20high%2C%20and%20additional%20supervision%20is%20required.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EAt%20%2445%20to%20%2485%20at%20the%20time%20of%20writing%2C%20these%20vests%20are%20the%20most%20expensive%20on%20our%20list.%20And%20as%20with%20any%20anxiety%20vest%2C%20you'll%20want%20to%20gradually%20introduce%20it%20to%20your%20dog%20and%20use%20it%20under%20close%20supervision%2C%20as%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.vet.cornell.edu%2Fabout-us%2Fpeople%2Fbrian-collins-dvm%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EDr.%20Brian%20Collins%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20a%20veterinarian%20with%20the%20Cornell%20Riney%20Canine%20Health%20Center%2C%20points%20out.%20However%2C%20this%20particular%20vest%20poses%20the%20additional%20risk%20of%20ingesting%20the%20insert.%20Though%20nontoxic%2C%20it%20could%20still%20cause%20intestinal%20blockage%20or%20GI%20upset%20if%20ingested.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EIt%20might%20not%20be%20suitable%20for%20your%20dog%20or%20location.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3E%26quot%3BAlthough%20weighted%20vests%20are%20designed%20to%20add%20only%20a%20small%20percentage%20of%20the%20dog's%20body%20weight%2C%20dogs%20with%20preexisting%20neck%20or%20forelimb%20pain%2C%20mobility%20issues%2C%20or%20other%20musculoskeletal%20conditions%20should%20ideally%20be%20evaluated%20by%20a%20veterinarian%20before%20using%20one%2C%26quot%3B%20Collins%20says.%20Canada%20Pooch%20also%20states%20that%20it's%20not%20suitable%20for%20dogs%20with%20diabetes%2C%20low%20blood%20pressure%2C%20circulation%20issues%2C%20or%20sleep%20problems.%20Collins%20adds%20that%20weighted%20vests%20aren't%20appropriate%20to%20use%20in%20warm%20weather%2C%20during%20long%20walks%2C%20or%20when%20your%20dog%20has%20access%20to%20any%20body%20of%20water.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22bb23dc83-8022-4f37-8863-2a88e6475c01%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Best%20for%20hot%20weather%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EBest%20for%20hot%20weather%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EBest%20for%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EDogs%20who%20run%20hot%20or%20live%20in%20warmer%20climates%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ESkip%20this%20if%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EYou%20want%20a%20vest%20that's%20easier%20to%20put%20on.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EIf%20you%20have%20a%20dog%20who%20runs%20hot%20or%20needs%20a%20calming%20vest%20for%20the%20warmer%20months%2C%20this%20%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Ca%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3FamazonTrackingID%3Dbi-auto-15126885251y6j-20%26h%3Da2b3e06906d4aa10443835a4b421d3608e3eb1c8416b46dc7e014963392cae90%26postID%3D6a68b5802efa73b487435d59%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fpets%252Fbest-dog-anxiety-vest%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.chewy.com%252Famerican-kennel-club-akc-anxiety-vest%252Fdp%252F126869%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EAmerican%20Kennel%20Club%20Calming%20Coat%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cstrong%3E%20offers%20a%20lightweight%2C%20airy%20design.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EMade%20of%20a%20cotton%2C%20polyester%2C%20and%20spandex%20blend%2C%20the%20material%20is%20thin%20but%20still%20offers%20compression.%20When%20testing%20this%20vest%2C%20I%20put%20it%20on%20Roo%20when%20she%20began%20pacing%2C%20whining%2C%20and%20staring%20at%20me%20after%20the%20back%20downstairs%20door%20began%20creaking%20and%20popping%20as%20it%20expanded%20in%20the%20afternoon%20sun.%20After%20going%20upstairs%20and%20putting%20on%20the%20AKC%20vest%2C%20Roo%20was%20able%20to%20settle%2C%20and%20I%20could%20finish%20out%20my%20workday.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EThe%20price%20of%20this%20vest%20is%20hard%20to%20beat%2C%20especially%20for%20larger%20dogs.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EUnlike%20other%20options%20on%20our%20list%20that%20increase%20the%20cost%20with%20size%2C%20this%20anxiety%20wrap%20offers%20the%20same%20price%20across%20the%20board.%20Smaller%20pups%20will%20be%20out%20of%20luck%2C%20though%2C%20as%20it%20doesn't%20fit%20dogs%20under%2010%20pounds.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221920%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20tan%20dog%20wears%20a%20blue%20AKC%20calming%20vest%20while%20sitting%20and%20lying%20down%2C%20showing%20the%20vest's%20wraparound%20fit%20and%20wide%20adjustable%20closures%20from%20the%20front%20and%20back.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6904eb548c9c486b31182a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221440%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EElizabeth%20Holbrook%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhile%20this%20vest%20follows%20the%20usual%20design%20of%20wrapping%20around%20the%20chest%20and%20waist%2C%20it's%20not%20as%20intuitive%20as%20the%20others.%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20Its%20differing%20strap%20lengths%2C%20as%20well%20as%20a%20slit%20where%20one%20strap%20fits%20through%2C%20were%20quite%20confusing%20to%20figure%20out%20at%20first.%20I%20had%20to%20go%20online%20to%20find%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fshop.akc.org%2Fproducts%2Fchewy-akc-anxiety-vest-for-dogs%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebrand's%20instructions%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20understand%20how%20to%20put%20it%20on%20Roo.%20And%20even%20then%2C%20it%20took%20me%20a%20while%20to%20put%20it%20on%20her%20correctly.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2281fb3d15-7ed7-4462-9e85-b24c2f4d238f%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22What%20to%20look%20for%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat%20to%20look%20for%20in%20an%20anxiety%20vest%20for%20your%20dog%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EFinding%20the%20best%20anxiety%20vest%20for%20your%20dog%20is%20a%20highly%20individual%20choice%2C%20but%20here%20are%20a%20few%20guidelines%20to%20consider.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EFit%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThe%20fit%20is%20the%20most%20important%20feature%20of%20an%20anxiety%20vest%2C%20Pritchard%20says.%20It%20should%20be%20snug%20enough%20to%20apply%20pressure%20without%20being%20restrictive.%20The%20material%20should%20also%20be%20breathable%20to%20prevent%20overheating.%20Fabrics%20like%20cotton%2C%20nylon%2C%20polyester%2C%20and%20rayon%20are%20all%20great%20options%20for%20breathability.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EEasy%20to%20put%20on%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThe%20best%20anxiety%20dog%20vests%20will%20also%20be%20easy%20to%20put%20on%20and%20adjust.%20%26quot%3BIf%20the%20dog%20hates%20putting%20it%20on%2C%20it%20probably%20isn't%20going%20to%20help%20much%2C%26quot%3B%20Pritchard%20says.%20Vests%20with%20a%20traditional%20design%20that%20have%20straps%20that%20wrap%20around%20the%20chest%20and%20then%20around%20the%20belly%20are%20the%20simplest%20to%20put%20on.%20These%20typically%20have%20Velcro%20on%20the%20straps%2C%20making%20them%20easy%20to%20adjust%20to%20fit%20your%20dog's%20body.%20Vests%20with%20a%20Y-shaped%20design%20that%20go%20over%20the%20head%20will%20likely%20be%20unpleasant%20for%20some%20pups.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EAdded%20features%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThe%20vest%20you%20choose%20for%20your%20dog%20will%20depend%20on%20your%20home%20environment%20and%20their%20particular%20stressors.%20For%20instance%2C%20dogs%20who%20have%20a%20hard%20time%20with%20loud%20noises%20might%20benefit%20from%20having%20a%20vest%20that%20includes%20a%20hood%20or%20a%20built-in%20noise%20machine%20for%20sound%20masking.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EPrice%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20Since%20there's%20no%20guarantee%20that%20an%20anti-anxiety%20vest%20will%20help%20calm%20your%20pup%2C%20look%20for%20options%20that%20are%20in%20your%20budget.%20Anderson%20also%20recommends%20choosing%20one%20with%20a%20money-back%20guarantee%20in%20case%20it%20doesn't%20work%20or%20your%20dog%20can't%20tolerate%20wearing%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2283b87585-63ac-4849-a838-e20d1d559b60%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22FAQs%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EDog%20anxiety%20vest%20FAQs%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Ch3%3EDo%20anxiety%20vests%20work%20for%20dogs%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EAnti-anxiety%20vests%20won't%20work%20for%20every%20dog%2C%20but%20they%20may%20help%20pups%20who%20have%20mild%20to%20moderate%20anxiety.%20By%20snugly%20wrapping%20around%20a%20dog's%20body%2C%20a%20vest%20adds%20constant%20pressure%20that%20some%20pups%20find%20calming.%20Slowly%20introducing%20your%20dog%20to%20a%20calming%20wrap%20and%20getting%20them%20used%20to%20wearing%20it%20repeatedly%20may%20also%20make%20it%20more%20effective%2C%20says%20Anderson%2C%20as%20you%20want%20your%20dog%20to%20feel%20comfortable%20while%20wearing%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%3EWhat%20is%20the%20best%20treatment%20for%20anxiety%20in%20dogs%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20best%20treatment%20for%20anxiety%20will%20depend%20on%20your%20particular%20dog.%20If%20a%20vest%20doesn't%20help%2C%20Pritchard%20says%20other%20options%20could%20include%20behavior%20modification%20training%2C%20prescription%20medications%2C%20pheromone%20products%2C%20or%20food%20enrichment%20toys.%20She%20also%20advises%20working%20with%20a%20veterinarian%20or%20board-certified%20veterinary%20behaviorist%20if%20you%20have%20a%20dog%20with%20severe%20anxiety.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%3EWhat%20are%20the%20most%20common%20dog%20anxiety%20triggers%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3ECommon%20anxiety%20triggers%20in%20dogs%20include%20loud%20noises%20%E2%80%94%20like%20from%20thunderstorms%20or%20fireworks%20%E2%80%94%20being%20separated%20from%20their%20guardians%2C%20vet%20visits%2C%20travel%2C%20and%20unfamiliar%20people%20or%20dogs%2C%20Pritchard%20says.%20She%20adds%20that%20some%20dogs%20also%20become%20anxious%20when%20their%20routine%20changes%20or%20as%20they%20get%20older%20and%20experience%20cognitive%20decline.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%3EWhat%20do%20vets%20recommend%20for%20calming%20dogs%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EAnderson%20recommends%20identifying%20your%20dog's%20triggers%20and%20avoiding%20them%20when%20possible.%20For%20example%2C%20she%20says%20that%20if%20your%20dog%20is%20afraid%20of%20noises%2C%20one%20of%20the%20best%20things%20you%20can%20do%20is%20provide%20them%20with%20a%20sanctuary%20space%20away%20from%20triggers%2C%20where%20all%20their%20needs%20are%20met.%20This%20could%20look%20like%20a%20quiet%20room%20in%20your%20house%20with%20fresh%20water%2C%20a%20comfy%20bed%2C%20puzzle%20toys%2C%20and%20other%20items%20or%20activities%20your%20dog%20enjoys.%20Anderson%20says%20a%20white%20noise%20machine%20is%20also%20very%20helpful%20for%20buffering%20scary%20noises%20and%20calming%20them%20down.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fpets%2Fbest-dog-anxiety-vest%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785271022000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a690f8c54f987526177abd5%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fpets%2Fbest-dog-anxiety-vest%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22I%20tested%20dog%20anxiety%20vests%20on%20my%20dog%20to%20see%20which%20helped%20most%20with%20noise%20anxiety.%20These%20are%20the%20best%20options%20for%20different%20dogs%20and%20situations.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Elizabeth%20Holbrook%2CSorin%20McKnight)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Boost%20Mobile%20Is%20Making%20First%20Phones%20More%20Affordable%20for%20Back-to-School%20Season%26nbsp%3B%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785270637000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fvariety.com%2F%3Fp%3D1236822849%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Back-to-school%20shopping%20usually%20means%20backpacks%2C%C2%A0notebooks%C2%A0and%20dorm-room%20basics.%20But%20for%20many%20families%2C%20a%20phone%20plan%20%E2%80%94%20or%20a%20first%20phone%20%E2%80%94%20has%20become%20just%20as%20essential.%C2%A0%20Boost%20Mobile%20is%20leaning%20into%20that%20rite%20of%20passage%20with%20a%20slate%20of%20back-to-school%20tech%20deals%20