d%20existing%20buildings%20are%20all%20potential%20options%2C%20according%20to%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fsam.gov%2Fworkspace%2Fcontract%2Fopp%2Faad620a730194f0d8b55121e70d5c098%2Fview%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Erequest%20for%20information%3C%2Fa%3E%20posted%20online%20by%20the%20service.%20Even%20houseboats%20are%20on%20the%20table.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20goal%20is%20to%20find%20innovative%20solutions%20that%20meet%20strict%20quality%20and%20safety%20standards%20without%20disrupting%20critical%20training%20and%20naval%20operations%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20service%20said%20in%20the%20announcement.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221798%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Rear%20Adm.%20Stephen%20Barnett%20tours%20a%20barracks%20room%20at%20the%20USS%20Cole%20bachelor%20enlisted%20quarters%20at%20Naval%20Station%20Great%20Lakes%2C%20Illinois%2C%20Mar.%2023%2C%20%202026%2C%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a68e977548c9c486b3116f9%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221200%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ERear%20Adm.%20Stephen%20Barnett%20tours%20a%20barracks%20room%20at%20the%20USS%20Cole%20bachelor%20enlisted%20quarters%20at%20Naval%20Station%20Great%20Lakes%2C%20Illinois%2C%20Mar.%2023%2C%202026%2C%3Cp%3ESpecialist%201st%20Class%20Brian%20T.%20Glunt%2FUS%20Navy%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20military%20has%20struggled%20with%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-military-barracks-troops-filthy-conditions-mold-sewage-pests-suicide-2023-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Edilapidated%20facilities%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20years%2C%20including%20the%20spaces%20troops%20live%20and%20work%20in.%20Complicating%20efforts%20to%20repair%20them%20is%20the%20military's%20regular%20practice%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flawmakers-push-to-prevent-barracks-funds-from-supporting-domestic-operations-2025-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eredirecting%20facilities%20money%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20other%20projects%2C%20such%20as%20deploying%20troops%20to%20the%20southern%20border.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20recent%20government%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Ffiles.gao.gov%2Freports%2FGAO-26-108437%2Findex.html%3F_gl%3D1*m0ums8*_ga*MTE0MzYzMTA5MS4xNzc4NzAwNjIx*_ga_V393SNS3SR*czE3ODUyNTM5MDYkbzEzJGcwJHQxNzg1MjUzOTA2JGo2MCRsMCRoMA..%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ewatchdog%20report%3C%2Fa%3E%20examining%20the%20US%20security%20mission%20along%20the%20southern%20border%20found%20that%20the%20Pentagon%20had%20redirected%20%241.264%20billion%20in%20funding%20for%20military%20%26quot%3Bfacilities%20sustainment%2C%20restoration%2C%20and%20modernization%26quot%3B%20in%20fiscal%20year%202025%20to%20support%20southern%20border%20operations%2C%20which%20have%20cost%20the%20government%20%242.64%20billion%20in%20total%20so%20far.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20report%20did%20not%20identify%20the%20facilities%20or%20projects%20affected%20by%20the%20realignment%20or%20determine%20whether%20particular%20barracks%20repairs%20could%20be%20delayed.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDefense%20Secretary%20Pete%20Hegseth%20established%20a%20department-wide%20Barracks%20Task%20Force%20last%20fall%2C%20funded%20with%20%241.2%20billion%20for%20military%20repairs%20and%20renovations%2C%20drawing%20from%20funding%20provided%20by%20President%20Donald%20Trump's%20One%20Big%20Beautiful%20Bill.%20The%20Navy%20received%20%24375%20million%20of%20that%20funding.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Pentagon%20did%20not%20respond%20to%20questions%20from%20Business%20Insider%20about%20the%20task%20force's%20recent%20accomplishments%20beyond%20funding%20allocations.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BImproving%20living%20conditions%20is%20a%20top%20priority%20for%20the%20Navy%2C%20but%20comprehensive%20upgrades%20require%20significant%20structural%20work%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20service%20said%20in%20its%20Monday%20announcement.%20%26quot%3BTo%20safely%20conduct%20the%20deep%20renovations%20needed%20to%20modernize%20aging%20facilities%2C%20entire%20barracks%20must%20be%20vacated.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20temporary%20housing%20will%20make%20way%20for%20%26quot%3Bmassive%20construction%20projects%26quot%3B%20to%20upgrade%20facilities%2C%20the%20Navy%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BOur%20sailors%20are%20our%20most%20critical%20asset%2C%20and%20providing%20them%20with%20safe%2C%20clean%2C%20and%20comfortable%20living%20quarters%20is%20a%20fundamental%20responsibility%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Vice%20Adm.%20Scott%20Gray%2C%20Commander%2C%20Navy%20Installations%20Command.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnavy-considers-houseboats-and-rvs-for-sailors-amid-barracks-overhaul-2026-7%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785269941000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a68e881548c9c486b3116f7%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnavy-considers-houseboats-and-rvs-for-sailors-amid-barracks-overhaul-2026-7%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22The%20Navy%20is%20seeking%20out%20thousands%20of%20temporary%20beds%20as%20recruiting%20growth%20and%20major%20barracks%20renovations%20strain%20its%20housing%20capacity.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22kbaker%40insider.com%20(Kelsey%20Baker)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A98%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Ryan%20Murphy%26nbsp%3Bto%20Receive%26nbsp%3BThird%20Annual%26nbsp%3BNorman%20Lear%20Award%20at%20Variety%20Showrunners%26nbsp%3BBreakfast%26nbsp%3B%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785269618000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fvariety.com%2F%3Fp%3D1236822845%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Variety%E2%80%98s%20annual%20Showrunners%20Breakfast%20will%20return%20on%20August%2014%2C%20featuring%20two%20spotlight%20conversations%20with%20a%20curated%20group%20of%20this%20year%E2%80%99s%20Emmy-nominated%20showrunn