during%20a%20deadlift.%20But%2C%20as%20an%20aesthetic%20girl%2C%20there%20were%20certain%20occasions%20when%20I'd%20leave%20it%20at%20home.%20The%20thicker%20profile%20felt%20a%20little%20too%20obvious%20for%20weddings%20or%20trips%20where%20I%20knew%20I'd%20be%20taking%20lots%20of%20cute%20photos.%20It's%20much%20more%20subtle%20than%20a%20smartwatch%2C%20but%20it%20still%20whispers%20%26quot%3Bwearable%26quot%3B%20a%20bit%20too%20loudly%20for%20me.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3FamazonTrackingID%3Dbi-auto-151268838858x-20%26h%3Dc69a931f06a57b3dfebf613d1e16cd45618fb9954189c626d6dddca25aa0140d%26postID%3D6a67b159a490e543c255c753%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Foura-ring-5-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.amazon.com%252Fdp%252FB0GRKCQPYH%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EOura%20Ring%205%3C%2Fa%3E%20doesn't%20even%20look%20like%20a%20wearable%2C%20especially%20if%20you%20already%20wear%20a%20ring%20stack.%20Though%20it's%20only%202%20cm%20narrower%2C%20it%20looks%20much%20more%20like%20a%20typical%20ring%2C%20to%20the%20point%20that%20it%20doesn't%20stand%20out.%20It's%20the%20same%20width%20as%20a%20standard%20male%20wedding%20band.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20also%20found%20the%20lighter%20weight%20makes%20it%20easier%20to%20forget%20about%20it%20while%20sleeping%2C%20working%2C%20lifting%20weights%2C%20or%20traveling.%20Oura%20becomes%20more%20accurate%20the%20longer%20you%20wear%20it%2C%20so%20comfort%20is%20crucial%20to%20getting%20the%20most%20out%20of%20the%20device.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Our%20reviewer's%20hand%20with%20pale%20manicured%20nails%20and%20an%20Oura%20Ring%205%20and%20an%20Oura%20Ring%204%20rests%20on%20dark%20pants%20beside%20brick%20pavement.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a67bb38548c9c486b311113%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222250%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Oura%20Ring%205%20looks%20more%20like%20a%20regular%20ring%20than%20the%20thicker%20Oura%20Ring%204.%3Cp%3ERachael%20Schultz%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWith%20the%20size%20reduction%2C%20the%20Ring%205%20has%20fewer%20sensors%20than%20its%20predecessor%2C%20with%2012%20signal%20pathways%20versus%2018%20in%20the%20Ring%204.%20(The%20sensors%20are%20what%20track%20your%20biometrics%20for%2C%20ideally%2C%20uninterrupted%20data%20coming%20in.)%20But%20the%20Ring%205%20is%20also%20designed%20with%20new%20low-profile%20sensor%20domes%2C%20which%20the%20brand%20says%20provide%20better%20contact%20with%20your%20skin%20and%20greater%20accuracy%20across%20finger%20sizes%20and%20skin%20types.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20didn't%20see%20any%20differences%20or%20dips%20in%20the%20consistency%20of%20incoming%20data%20during%20my%20four%20weeks%20of%20testing%2C%20and%20I%20found%20the%20data%20to%20be%20just%20as%20reliable%20as%20the%20Ring%204.%20I%20also%20didn't%20notice%20any%20differences%20in%20the%20health%20metrics%20themselves%2C%20which%20makes%20sense%20considering%20the%20previous%20generation%20was%20already%20excellent.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOura%20says%20the%20new%20sensors%20improve%20tracking%20accuracy%2C%20while%20the%20titanium%20construction%20is%20even%20more%20scratch-resistant%20than%20before.%20After%20a%20month%20of%2024%2F7%20wear%2C%20my%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3FamazonTrackingID%3Dbi-auto-151268838858x-20%26h%3Dc69a931f06a57b3dfebf613d1e16cd45618fb9954189c626d6dddca25aa0140d%26postID%3D6a67b159a490e543c255c753%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Foura-ring-5-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.amazon.com%252Fdp%252FB0GRKCQPYH%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ERing%205%3C%2Fa%3E%20still%20looks%20practically%20brand%20new%20and%2C%20indeed%2C%20is%20less%20scratched%20than%20my%20Ring%204%20was%20after%20the%20s