20Oura%20Ring%20is%20our%20go-to%20wearable%20for%20everyday%20health%20metrics.%3Cp%3ERachael%20Schultz%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20tested%20nearly%2020%20fitness%20and%20health%20trackers%20over%20the%20last%20year%2C%20from%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Fbest-garmin-watch%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EGarmin%20running%20watches%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20Google's%20new%20faceless%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Ffitbit-air-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EFitbit%20Air%3C%2Fa%3E.%20I%20consider%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Fgarmin-vivoactive-6-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EGarmin%20Vivoactive%206%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20be%20the%C2%A0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Fbest-fitness-trackers%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebest%20fitness%20wearable%3C%2Fa%3E%C2%A0for%20tracking%20workouts%2C%20and%20it's%20what%20I%20put%20on%20whenever%20I%20exercise.%20However%2C%20the%20Oura%20Ring%20is%20the%20device%20I%20choose%20to%20wear%20every%20day%20for%20general%20health%20tracking.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat's%20because%20it%20embraces%20what%20Oura%20calls%20%26quot%3Bquiet%20technology.%26quot%3B%20There%20are%20no%20buzzing%20notifications%2C%20incoming%20texts%2C%20or%20reminders%20to%20stand%20up%20(though%20the%20app%20can%20send%20a%20%26quot%3Btime%20to%20stretch%20your%20legs%26quot%3B%20push%20notification%20to%20your%20phone%20if%20you%20want).%20The%20Oura%20Ring%20is%20powered%20by%20its%20sensors%20and%20pathways%20to%20maintain%20as%20continuous%20a%20signal%20as%20possible%20for%20uninterrupted%20heart%20rate%20and%20skin%20temperature%20data.%20It%20collects%20everything%20while%20you%20go%20about%20your%20day%2C%20then%20presents%20it%20in%20one%20of%20the%20most%20intuitive%20health%20apps%20I've%20used.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESleep%20tracking%20remains%20where%20Oura%20shines%20brightest.%20Each%20morning%2C%20the%20app%20gives%20me%20an%20easy-to-understand%20Sleep%20Score%2C%20along%20with%20insights%20into%20my%20sleep%20stages%2C%20heart%20rate%2C%20body%20temperature%2C%20and%20overnight%20recovery.%20I've%20also%20come%20to%20rely%20heavily%20on%20the%20Readiness%20Score%2C%20which%20combines%20more%20than%2020%20biometric%20signals%20to%20tell%20you%20whether%20your%20body%20is%20primed%20for%20a%20hard%20workout%20or%20would%20be%20better%20served%20by%20taking%20it%20easy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20was%20initially%20skeptical%20of%20relying%20on%20a%20recovery%20score%20%E2%80%94%20don't%20I%20already%20know%20when%20I'm%20tired%20and%20need%20rest%3F%20But%20after%20wearing%20the%20Ring%20daily%20for%20an%20extended%20period%2C%20I've%20found%20it%20remarkably%20accurate.%20More%20than%20once%2C%20the%20Ring%20has%20flagged%20elevated%20body%20temperature%20or%20unusually%20poor%20recovery%20before%20I%20realized%20I%20was%20getting%20sick%2C%20convincing%20me%20to%20swap%20an%20intense%20workout%20for%20a%20walk%20or%20a%20rest%20day%20before%20symptoms%20fully%20set%20in.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222600%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Two%20smartphones%20display%20Oura%20app%20Cycle%20Insights%20screens%20with%20menstrual%20cycle%20day%20information%20and%20temperature%20charts.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a68f63854f987526177aadb%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221950%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Oura%20app%20offers%20detailed%20health%20tracking%2C%20but%20advanced%20metrics%2C%20like%20cycle%20data%2C%20require%20a%20membership.%3Cp%3EOura%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWomen's%20health%20tracking%20also%20remains%20among%20the%20best%20available%20in%20any%20wearable.%20By%20combining%20overnight%20skin%20temperature%20with%20cycle%20data%20and%20integrations%20%E2%80%94%20including%20Natural%20Cycles%2C%20Clue%2C%20and%20Mira%20%E2%80%94%20the%20app%20can%20estimate%20menstrual%20phases%2C%20predict%20ovulation%20windows%2C%20and%20provide%20increasingly%20personalized%20insights.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Oura%20app%20was%20redesigned%20last%20year%20and%20remains%20streamlined%2C%20intuitively%20organized%2C%20and%20easy%20to%20navigate.%20It%20simplifies%20complex%20biometrics%20into%20easy-to-understand%20health%20insights%2C%20and%20the%20AI%20Advisor%20can%20answer%20questions%20about%20recovering%20better%2C%20having%20more%20energy%20while%20menstruating%2C%20or%20improving%20your%20sleep%20(although%20the%20newly%20relaunched%20Google%20Health%20app%20does%20this%20better%2C%20in%20my%20opinion).%20Considering%20a%20smart%20ring%20has%20no%20display%2C%20the%20app%20is%20arguably%20half%20the%20product%20you're%20buying%2C%20and%20Oura's%20holds%20up%20to%20the%20ring's%20price.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20keep%20in%20mind%20that%20unlocking%20all%20of%20the%20app's%20insights%20requires%20a%20monthly%20subscription.%20In%20addition%20to%20the%20%24400%20to%20%24500%20price%20of%20the%20ring%20itself%20(depending%20on%20the%20finish%20you%20choose)%2C%20an%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3FamazonTrackingID%3Dbi-auto-151268838858x-20%26h%3D5f82df83713f70a4fb98254b5c3bebe13d517ceaf58ab466ed430cd1aa086555%26postID%3D6a67b159a490e543c255c753%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Foura-ring-5-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fouraring.com%252Fmembership%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EOura%20membership%3C%2Fa%3E%20costs%20%246%20a%20month.%20You%20can%20get%20basic%20metrics%20%E2%80%94%20readiness%2C%20sleep%2C%20and%20activity%20%E2%80%94%20for%20free%2C%20but%20the%20majority%20of%20the%20Oura%20Ring's%20features%20require%20a%20subscription%2C%20and%20most%20people%20will%20want%20those%20additional%20insights.%20In%20that%20sense%2C%20you%20should%20factor%20in%20the%20subscription%20cost%20when%20considering%20the%20device.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%227da4d486-cbbb-44ab-a37f-f42fb8aceab6%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Who%20should%20buy%20it%3F%5C%22%3EWho%20should%20buy%20the%20Oura%20Ring%205%3F%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Open%20hand%20held%20in%20sunlight%20with%20an%20Oura%20Ring%205%20on%20one%20finger%20over%20gravel%20ground.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a67ba65548c9c486b31110c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222250%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Oura%20Ring%20is%20great%20for%20discreet%20health%20insights%20between%20workouts%2C%20but%20it's%20not%20ideal%20for%20real-time%20fitness%20data%20during%20exercise.%3Cp%3ERachael%20Schultz%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20you%20want%20the%20health%20tracking%20and%20insights%20of%20a%20wearable%20but%20don't%20want%20either%20all%20the%20pings%20and%20notifications%20of%20a%20smartwatch%20or%20the%20visual%20of%20an%20overt%20wearable%2C%20the%20Oura%20Ring%20is%20definitely%20the%20way%20to%20go%2C%20and%20the%20slimmer%2C%20lighter%20design%20of%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3FamazonTrackingID%3Dbi-auto-151268838858x-20%26h%3Dc69a931f06a57b3dfebf613d1e16cd45618fb9954189c626d6dddca25aa0140d%26postID%3D6a67b159a490e543c255c753%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Foura-ring-5-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.amazon.com%252Fdp%252FB0GRKCQPYH%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ERing%205%3C%2Fa%3E%20makes%20this%20the%20best%20one%20to%20buy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20you%20already%20own%20the%20Oura%20Ring%204%2C%20the%20Ring%205%20isn't%20an%20essential%20upgrade%20%E2%80%94%20but%20if%20aesthetics%20are%20important%20to%20you%20and%20you%20regularly%20take%20your%20ring%20off%20for%20nice%20dinners%20and%20photos%2C%20it's%20probably%20worth%20switching.%20(Worth%20noting%3A%20Oura%20Rings%20are%20HSA%2FFSA%20eligible.)%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20the%20Oura%20Ring%205%20isn't%20the%20right%20wearable%20for%20everyone.%20If%20you're%20training%20for%20a%20race%2C%20want%20real-time%20heart%20rate%20zones%20or%20pace%2C%20or%20want%20a%20detailed%20analysis%20of%20your%20workouts%2C%20you'll%20be%20happier%20with%20a%20more%20fitness-geared%20tracker%20like%20a%20Garmin%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Fbest-fitbit%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EFitbit%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20or%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Fbest-apple-watch%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EApple%20Watch%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Oura%20will%20log%20your%20workouts%20and%20movements%20and%20tell%20you%20your%20calorie%20burn%2C%20but%20it%20excels%20most%20at%20helping%20you%20understand%20your%20body%20between%20workouts%20%E2%80%94%20not%20coaching%20you%20through%20them.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22e67837dd-a4b1-4642-b3f9-6a8d18cb8c8a%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22The%20bottom%20line%5C%22%3EThe%20bottom%20line%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Our%20reviewer's%20hand%20wearing%20an%20Oura%20Ring%205%20held%20up%20outdoors%20against%20trees%20and%20a%20blue%20sky.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a67b877548c9c486b3110ed%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222250%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Oura%20Ring%205%20is%20one%20of%20our%20favorite%20health%20wearables.%3Cp%3ERachael%20Schultz%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Oura%20Ring%204%20was%20already%20my%20favorite%20smart%20ring%20and%20the%20health%20wearable%20I%20recommended%20most%20often.%20The%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3FamazonTrackingID%3Dbi-auto-151268838858x-20%26h%3Dc69a931f06a57b3dfebf613d1e16cd45618fb9954189c626d6dddca25aa0140d%26postID%3D6a67b159a490e543c255c753%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252