crude-supply-shortage-iran-war-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ejumped%20above%20%24100%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20the%20first%20time%20since%20May%20earlier%20this%20month.%20President%20Donald%20Trump%20continues%20to%20tease%20talks%20with%20Iran%20while%20also%20maintaining%20that%20attacks%20could%20resume%20if%20there%20isn't%20a%20deal%20soon.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20pause%20in%20the%20fighting%20announced%20over%20the%20weekend%20appeared%20to%20hold%20into%20this%20week%2C%20and%20talks%20between%20Iran%2C%20Saudi%20Arabia%2C%20and%20Oman%20about%20how%20getting%20the%20Strait%20of%20Hormuz%20reopened%20helped%20push%20crude%20prices%20down%20further.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThere's%20definitely%20still%20a%20lot%20of%20volatility%20in%20the%20oil%20markets%2C%26quot%3B%20stated%20Morningstar%20chief%20market%20strategist%20Dave%20Sekera.%20%26quot%3BWe've%20seen%20this%20exact%20same%20setup%20multiple%20times%20over%20the%20past%20couple%20months.%20Essentially%2C%20during%20the%20week%2C%20there's%20military%20action%20and%20retaliation%2C%20but%20then%20it%20always%20seems%20that%20Sunday%20evening%2C%20before%20futures%20open%2C%20there%20are%20headlines%20out%20there%20that%20each%20side%20has%20agreed%20to%20de-escalation.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20volatility%20in%20oil%20comes%20at%20a%20critical%20time%20as%20investors%20prepare%20for%20the%20Federal%20Reserve's%20July%2029%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsurprise-rate-hike-july-fed-meeting-kevin-warsh-neil-dutta-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Erate%20decision%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Between%20the%20question%20about%20the%20central%20bank's%20new%20chairman%20and%20several%20high%20stakes%20earnings%20reports%2C%20uncertainty%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstock-market-outlook-this-week-fed-meeting-big-tech-earnings-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eis%20running%20high%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20markets.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELower%20oil%2