%22%3A%22The%20uncertainty%20heading%20into%20Wednesday's%20rate%20decision%20is%20unusually%20high.%20The%20market%20sees%20strong%20odds%20for%20a%20rate%20hike%20at%20some%20point%20this%20year.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22jsor%40businessinsider.com%20(Jennifer%20Sor)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A97%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22An%20Alabama%20animal%20shelter%20is%20taking%20on%20a%20massive%20AI%20data%20center%20project%20in%20court%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223502%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20rendering%20of%20Nebius'%20data%20center%20in%20Birmingham.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a68e7e0548c9c486b3116f2%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221972%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EA%20rendering%20of%20Nebius'%20data%20center%20project%20in%20Birmingham.%3Cp%3ENebius%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EAn%20Alabama%20animal%20shelter%20is%20suing%20to%20block%20a%20massive%20AI%20data%20center%20project%20in%20Birmingham.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20Greater%20Birmingham%20Humane%20Society%20alleges%20the%20city%20and%20developers%20bypassed%20zoning%20rules.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAI%20data%20centers%20have%20been%20drawing%20pushback%20from%20communities%20across%20the%20country.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EAn%20Alabama%20animal%20shelter%20is%20barking%20back%20against%20a%20massive%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-data-center-near-me-location-tracker-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAI%20data%20center%20%3C%2Fa%3Ethat's%20under%20construction%20next%20to%20its%20planned%20veterinary%20hospital%20campus%20in%20Birmingham.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Greater%20Birmingham%20Humane%20Society%20filed%20a%20lawsuit%20earlier%20this%20month%20in%20a%20bid%20to%20block%20the%20project%2C%20alleging%20that%20the%20city%20of%20Birmingham%2C%20AL%2C%20and%20developers%20engaged%20in%20a%20%26quot%3Bmonths-long%20scheme%26quot%3B%20to%20greenlight%20it%20by%20sidestepping%20zoning%20rules.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20lawsuit%2C%20filed%20in%20Jefferson%20County%20Circuit%20Court%2C%20says%20that%20the%20four-month%20review%20for%20building%20permits%20for%20the%20more%20than%20%242%20billion%20facility%20moved%20at%20%26quot%3Blightning%20speed%26quot%3B%20compared%20with%20the%2018-month%20review%20for%20the%20nonprofits'%20planned%20%2467%20million%20campus.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEntities%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnebius-ceo-arkady-volozh-ai-meta-yandex-data-centers-compute-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ENebius%20Group%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20the%20Amsterdam-headquartered%20AI%20infrastructure%20company%20behind%20the%20data%20center%20project%2C%20%26quot%3Bcoordinated%26quot%3B%20with%20the%20city%20to%20%26quot%3Babuse%20legal%20processes%20and%20manipulate%20timelines%20to%20fast-track%20a%20favored%20project%20without%20due%20process%2C%20regard%20for%20the%20law%2C%20or%20public%20welfare%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20lawsuit%20alleges.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20Nebius%20spokesperson%20told%20Business%20Insider%20that%20the%20project%20was%20%26quot%3Bpermitted%20lawfully%20in%20this%20commercial%20district%20and%20Nebius%20has%20followed%20the%20same%20rules%20that%20apply%20to%20everyone%20else%20in%20Birmingham.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20facility%20has%20also%20been%20thoughtfully%20designed%20and%20responsibly%20developed%20with%20measures%20including%20acoustical%20sound%20walls%2C%20grid%20power%2C%20and%20closed-loop%20cooling%2C%20among%20other%20areas%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20spokesperson%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20spokesperson%20for%20the%20city%20of%20Birmingham%20said%20the%20city%20does%20not%20comment%20on%20ongoing%20litigation.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20humane%20society's%20lawsuit%20says%20that%20the%20organization%20previously%20notified%20the%20city%20and%20its%20zoning%20board%20that%20the%20data%20center%20project%20%26quot%3Bcould%20deprive%26quot%3B%20it%20%26quot%3Bof%20the%20planned%20use%20of%20its%20property%20because%20of%20noise%20that%20may%20interfere%20with%20its%20operations%20and%20be%20harmful%20to%20animals%20and%20humans.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20data%20center%20is%20being%20built%20about%20160%20feet%20from%20the%20property%20line%20of%20GBHS's%20future%20animal%20welfare%20campus%2C%20which%20is%20expected%20to%20include%20an%20adoption%20center%2C%20outdoor%20rehabilitation%20areas%2C%20and%20foster%20facilities%2C%20the%20nonprofit%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThis%20case%20is%20not%20about%20whether%20data%20centers%20should%20exist%2C%26quot%3B%20Allison%20Black%20Cornelius%2C%20the%20president%20and%20CEO%20of%20the%20GBHS%2C%20said%20in%20a%20statement.%20%26quot%3BIt%20is%20about%20whether%20a%20project%20of%20this%20size%20and%20character%20should%20move%20forward%20in%20this%20location%20without%20the%20legal%20questions%20surrounding%20its%20approval%20first%20being%20resolved.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECornelius%20added%2C%20%26quot%3BWe%20believe%20neighboring%20institutions%2C%20nonprofit%20organizations%2C%20residents%2C%20and%20the%20broader%20community%20deserve%20confidence%20that%20the%20applicable%20laws%20and%20procedures%20have%20been%20followed.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENebius'%20data%20center%20has%20also%20drawn%20separate%20legal%20action%20from%20area%20residents%2C%20according%20to%20local%20media%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.wbrc.com%2F2026%2F07%2F11%2Fjudge-rules-oxmoor-valley-neighbors-lawsuit-against-nebius-data-center-can-proceed%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ereports%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20pushback%20comes%20amid%20growing%20community%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdata-center-protests-ai-trade-markets-sei-be-morgan-stanley-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eopposition%20to%20AI%20data%20center%20projects%3C%2Fa%3E%20nationwide%2C%20driven%20by%20concerns%20about%20t