f%20pancake%20batter.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20followed%20the%20directions%20on%20my%20buttermilk%20pancake%20mix%2C%20but%20used%20a%20little%20less%20liquid%20to%20keep%20my%20batter%20on%20the%20thicker%20side.%20This%20way%2C%20the%20sandwich%20would%20be%20easier%20to%20evenly%20coat.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20dipped%20the%20sandwich%20in%20the%20batter%20and%20made%20sure%20to%20let%20the%20excess%20drip%20off.%20Then%2C%20I%20placed%20the%20dipped%20sandwich%20onto%20a%20parchment-paper%20liner%20I%20had%20punctured%20several%20times%20to%20ensure%20airflow.%20Into%20my%20air%20fryer%20it%20went.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22parchment-lined%20paper%20with%20the%20Monte%20Cristo%20on%20top%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F61f029b5702f4b001866e3f5%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI%20used%20a%20parchment%20sheet%20with%20holes%20poked%20in%20it%20to%20keep%20the%20air%20flow%20going.%3Cp%3EChelsea%20Davis%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20air-fried%20the%20sandwich%20for%20seven%20minutes%20on%20one%20side%2C%20then%20flipped%20and%20cooked%20for%20a%20minute%20more%20at%20380%20degrees%20Fahrenheit.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20wish%20I'd%20used%20cooking%20spray%20before%20putting%20the%20sandwich%20in%20the%20fryer%2C%20since%20it%20stuck%20a%20bit%20when%20I%20flipped%20it.%20Still%2C%20it%20stayed%20mostly%20intact.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Monte%20Cristo%20in%20air%20fryer%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F61f029952b43ff00185e73e7%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI%20love%20a%20regular%20ham%20and%20cheese%2C%20so%20I%20knew%20this%20would%20be%20good.%3Cp%3EChelsea%20Davis%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOnce%20it%20was%20golden%20brown%20and%20ready%2C%20I%20opted%20not%20to%20dust%20my%20sandwich%20with%20powdered%20sugar%20as%20the%20recipe%20suggests%20%E2%80%94%20but%20I'm%20sure%20that%20would%20have%20been%20delicious.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22edb23978-037e-404c-b135-a3a5b1743028%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EThis%20was%20super%20tasty%20and%20worth%20the%20effort%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Monte%20Cristo%20sandwich%20cut%20in%20half%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F61f029ad2b43ff00185e73ec%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Monte%20Cristo%20felt%20like%20it%20was%20basically%20meant%20to%20be%20air-fried.%3Cp%3EChelsea%20Davis%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20sandwich%20was%20indulgent%2C%20filling%2C%20and%20extra%20tasty%20thanks%20to%20the%20coating%20of%20pancake%20batter%20that%20created%20a%20crunchy%2C%20buttery%20exterior.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEach%20bite%20was%20a%20cheesy%20and%20satisfying%20experience.%C2%A0In%20general%2C%20any%20Monte%20Cristo%20variation%20feels%20like%20a%20great%20sandwich%20to%20make%20in%20an%20air%20fryer.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%229e7b7b97-bea1-4f95-82ba-b1b4bde7c36c%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3ELastly%2C%20I%20made%20a%20basic%20sandwich%C2%A0using%20leftover%20produce%20%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22pesto%2C%20mushrooms%2C%20cherry%20tomatoes%2C%20and%20bread%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F61f02a9f2b43ff00185e7460%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI%20already%20had%20most%20of%20the%20ingredients%20in%20my%20kitchen.%3Cp%3EChelsea%20Davis%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20this%20produce-packed%20sandwich%2C%20I%20improvised%20after%20reading%20a%20few%20different%20recipes%20online.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20started%20by%20air-frying%20sliced%20mushrooms%20for%20five%20minutes%20at%20390%20degrees%20Fahrenheit%2C%20then%20setting%20them%20aside.%20You%20can%20also%20add%20other%20produce%2C%20like%20bell%20peppers%2C%20during%20this%20step%20%E2%80%94%20anything%20you%20want%20to%20cook%20a%20little%20longer.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22pesto%2C%20sliced%20cherry%20tomatoes%2C%20and%20mushrooms%20on%20bread%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F61f02a8c2b43ff00185e7458%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThis%20sandwich%20is%20very%20customizable.%3Cp%3EChelsea%20Davis%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20assembled%20the%20sandwich%20by%20spreading%20pesto%20on%20both%20pieces%20of%20bread%2C%20then%20layering%20cheddar%20cheese%2C%20cooked%20mushrooms%2C%20and%20sliced%20cherry%20tomatoes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20sprayed%20the%20bread%20with%20cooking%20spray%20so%20it'd%20get%20crispy%20and%20golden%20brown%2C%20then%20popped%20it%20in%20the%20air%20fryer.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22pesto%2C%20sliced%20cherry%20tomatoes%2C%20and%20mushrooms%20on%20bread%20%20in%20an%20air%20fryer%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F61f02a9a702f4b001866e479%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMy%20veggie%20sandwich%20got%20nice%20and%20toasty.%3Cp%3EChelsea%20Davis%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20air-fried%20the%20sandwich%20at%20350%20degrees%20Fahrenheit%20for%20just%20a%20few%20minutes%2C%20until%20the%20bread%20was%20golden-brown%2C%20the%20tomatoes%20had%20blistered%2C%20and%20the%20cheese%20was%20melted.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%223bf98db5-438c-421e-be75-9cf0ebfc425f%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EThis%20recipe%20is%20a%20great%20way%20to%20use%20up%20leftovers%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22pesto%2C%20sliced%20cherry%20tomatoes%2C%20and%20mushrooms%20on%20bread%2C%20toasted%20and%20sliced%20in%20half%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F61f02a9f2b43ff00185e745d%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20veggie%20sandwich%20looked%20amazing.%3Cp%3EChelsea%20Davis%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20customizable%20veggie%20sandwich%20of%20sorts%20was%20tasty%20and%20simple.%20It%20could%20easily%20be%20made%20with%20a%20variety%20of%20cheeses%2C%20spreads%2C%20or%20leftover%20produce.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENext%20time%2C%20I'd%20use%20a%20heariter%20sourdough%20bread%20to%20better%20stand%20up%20to%20the%20contents%20of%20my%20sandwich.%20It%20started%20to%20fall%20apart%20a%20little%20bit%20as%20I%20ate.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20top%20of%20my%20sandwich%20blew%20off%20in%20the%20air%20fryer%20before%20it%20was%20done%2C%20so%20I'd%20also%20put%20cheese%20on%20both%20slices%20of%20bread%20in%20the%20future.%20Melty%20cheese%20is%20truly%20what%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftips-for-making-perfect-sandwich-guy-fieri-easy-upgrades-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebinds%20a%20sandwich%20together%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%228681efec-79c7-4cde-9440-c1da7039f535%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EOverall%2C%20I'd%20make%206%20of%20these%20sandwiches%20again%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EEach%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftrying-popular-air-fryer-recipes-from-desserts-to-dinners%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eair-fryer%20sandwich%3C%2Fa%3E%20was%20easy%20to%20make%20and%20yielded%20a%20melty%2C%20toasty%20result%20that%20might%20otherwise%20require%20a%20panini%20maker%20to%20make.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20favorites%20were%20the%20meatball%20sub%20and%20chicken%20Caprese%2C%20both%20of%20which%20could%20easily%20be%20the%20star%20components%20of%20a%20full%20meal.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20wouldn't%20make%20the%20mac-and-cheese%20grilled%20cheese%20again%2C%20but%20I%20can%20see%20a%20lot%20of%20others%20enjoying%20it.%20Fortunately%2C%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fthe-best-air-fryer-foods-of-the-year-recipes-photos