i.insider.com%2F6a4fe16db3a8c16f7e8ed001%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222183%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EElliot%20Marsh%20took%20a%20class%20to%20learn%20how%20to%20braid%20hair%20to%20connect%20with%20his%20daughter.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Elliot%20Marsh%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EElliot%20Marsh%20is%20a%2047-year-old%20dad%20in%20London%20with%20a%203-year-old%20daughter.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EHaving%20been%20raised%20with%20a%20brother%2C%20he%20found%20having%20a%20daughter%20a%20mystery.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EHe%20attended%20an%20event%20in%20a%20pub%20where%20he%20learned%20to%20braid%20his%20daughter's%20hair.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EThis%20as-told-to%20essay%20is%20based%20on%20a%20conversation%20with%20Elliot%20Marsh.%20It%20has%20been%20edited%20for%20length%20and%20clarity.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20I%20found%20out%20my%20wife%20and%20I%20were%20having%20a%20little%20girl%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhat-is-ivf-2018-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Efollowing%20IVF%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20I%20was%20absolutely%20delighted.%20We%20had%20spent%20years%20hoping%20to%20have%20a%20baby%2C%20and%20would%20finally%20be%20welcoming%20one%20into%20our%20family.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20over%20the%20moon%20to%20be%20expecting%20a%20girl%2C%20I%20also%20felt%20I%20was%20entering%20the%20unknown.%20Growing%20up%2C%20it%20was%20just%20my%20brother%20and%20me.%20My%20brother%20went%20on%20to%20have%20boys%2C%20so%20all%20I%20knew%20were%20boys.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fi-am-a-mom-of-4-girls-tired-of-comments-2022-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ERaising%20a%20girl%3C%2Fa%3E%20was%20a%20mystery%20to%20me%2C%20but%20also%20an%20adventure%20I%20couldn't%20wait%20for.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22fc239cf0-26cd-4493-b055-220cd669f3b9%5C%22%3EI%20love%20being%20a%20girl%20dad%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EShe's%203%20now%2C%20and%20I'm%20loving%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fkobe-bryant-photos-show-love-daughters-urged-to-play-sports-2020-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebeing%20a%20girl%20dad%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20but%20I%20don't%20have%20a%20clue%20what%20I'm%20doing%20a%20lot%20of%20the%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWithout%20any%20pressure%20or%20pushing%20from%20us%2C%20she%20has%20grown%20to%20love%20ballet%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmummy-pig-played-by-same-actor-for-18-years-2022-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EPeppa%20Pig%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20fairies%2C%20princesses%2C%20dresses%20that%20twirl%2C%20and%20cute%20hairstyles.%20I%20know%20it's%20just%20the%20start%20of%20her%20interests%20diverging%20from%20mine.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20don't%20know%20much%20about%20her%20current%20or%20future%20interests%2C%20but%20I%20want%20to%20be%20able%20to%20fully%20share%20in%20her%20excitement%20for%20them.%20I%20want%20her%20to%20feel%20she%20can%20talk%20to%20me%20about%20anything%20%E2%80%94%20for%20her%20to%20know%20I%20care%20about%20what%20she%20cares%20about.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Man%20taking%20selfie%20by%20the%20water%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a4fe2aeb3a8c16f7e8ed014%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EElliot%20Marsh%20loves%20being%20a%20girl%20dad.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Elliot%20Marsh%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EMore%20seriously%2C%20as%20she%20ages%2C%20gets%20her%20period%2C%20has%20a%20boyfriend%2C%20and%20deals%20with%20any%20number%20of%20issues%20that%20will%20come%20her%20way%2C%20I%20want%20to%20already%20have%20a%20line%20of%20communication%20open%20between%20the%20two%20of%20us.%20I%20don't%20want%20her%20to%20feel%20at%20all%20embarrassed%20to%20talk%20to%20me.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20it%20isn't%20only%20for%20her%20that%20I%20want%20this%20relationship%3B%20it's%20for%20me%2C%20too.%20I%20want%20to%20have%20a%20strong%20connection%20with%20my%20daughter%2C%20and%20I%20know%20that%20starts%20now.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2293aa0ea2-d9db-4b62-9c71-7efa19950ea9%5C%22%3EI%20joined%20a%20group%20of%20dads%20to%20learn%20how%20to%20do%20my%20daughter's%20hair%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20April%2C%20I%20saw%20an%20advertisement%20on%20social%20media%20for%20%26quot%3BPints%20and%20Ponytails.%26quot%3B%20At%20face%20value%2C%20it's%20about%20dads%20learning%20how%20to%20do%20their%20daughters'%20hair%20%E2%80%94%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwearing-braids-self-love-practice-from-my-dad-2023-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eponytails%20and%20braids%3C%2Fa%3E.%20It%20looked%20like%20fun%20and%20would%20be%20a%20valuable%20skill%20for%20me%20to%20learn.%20If%20I%20could%20do%20my%20daughter's%20hair%2C%20I'd%20take%20an%20interest%20in%20what%20was%20important%20to%20her%20and%20get%20a%20chance%20to%20have%20a%20chat%20with%20her%20in%20the%20process.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20showed%20up%20at%20a%20private%20room%20in%20a%20pub%2C%20and%20there%20were%2020%20mannequins%20on%20the%20tables.%20Each%20dad%20had%20a%20drink%20as%20we%20sat%20down%2C%20and%20the%20guys%20hosting%20it%20showed%20how%20to%20do%20various%20braids.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20learning%20to%20braid%20was%20valuable%2C%20it%20wasn't%20the%20best%20part%20of%20the%20evening.%20What%20I%20appreciated%20most%20was%20having%20a%20space%20to%20talk%20about%20being%20a%20dad%20with%20other%20dads.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%222104e65b-dbe2-4a7a-af0b-856022f9b9e3%5C%22%3EI%20got%20to%20chat%20with%20other%20dads%20about%20parenting%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20were%20a%20few%20guided%20questions%20to%20get%20conversations%20started.%20I%20remember%20one%20question%20being%3A%20What's%20the%20most%20difficult%20thing%20about%20being%20a%20parent%3F%20Most%20of%20us%20said%20we%20felt%20we%20were%20spread%20too%20thin.%20We%20have%20to%20be%20everything%20to%20everybody%20all%20the%20time%20%E2%80%94%20to%20be%20a%20good%20husband%2C%20son%2C%20parent%2C%20employer%2C%20employee%2C%20provider%2C%20and%20so%20on.%20Amid%20those%20roles%2C%20we%20start%20to%20feel%20lost%20as%20individuals.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20discussed%20aspects%20of%20parenting%20we%20loved%20most%2C%20and%20the%20cultural%20movement%20we%20are%20seeing%20%E2%80%94%20that%20dads%20desperately%20want%20to%20be%20active%20and%20involved%20as%20parents.%20Dads%20are%20showing%20up%20for%20their%20kids%20%E2%80%94%20for%20their%20daughters%20%E2%80%94%20and%20we%20need%20spaces%20to%20speak%20about%20the%20joys%20and%20the%20challenges%2C%20and%20about%20our%20feelings%20as%20we%20parent.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221958%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Girl's%20hair%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a4fe3c5d3b3e457651971c5%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221469%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EElliot%20Marsh%20has%20been%20doing%20his%20daughter's%20hair%20every%20day%20since%20taking%20a%20class.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Elliot%20Marsh%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20had%20never%20had%20a%20context%20like%20this%20to%20talk%20so%20freely%20with%20other%20dads.%20It%20was%20an%20intentional%2C%20lighthearted%2C%20fun%2C%20constructive%20night%20%E2%80%94%20that's%20why%20it%20works%20so%20well%20for%20dads.%20It's%20the%20perfect%20format%20to%20connect%20with%20guys.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESince%20that%20night%2C%20I've%20been%20doing%20my%20daughter's%20hair%20nearly%20every%20day.%20She's%20jumping%20all%20over%20the%20place%20when%20I%20do%20it%20%E2%80%94%20the%20trick%20is%20to%20keep%20her%20still%20%E2%80%94%20but%20I%20can%20do%20the%20double%20ponytail%20and%20the%20braid%20now.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20a%20lovely%20bonding%20moment%20we%20share%20every%20day%2C%20and%20one%20I%20hope%20continues%20for%20years%2C%20building%20a%20foundation%20that%20will%20help%20our%20relationship%20last%20forever.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20orig