%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22AI%20capex%20is%20the%20main%20event%20for%20Wall%20Street%20ahead%20of%20Meta's%20high-stakes%20Q2%20earnings%20report%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Mark%20Zuckerberg%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F69fdfdc2c9dd4cb81cda8883%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222666%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EBloomberg%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EMeta%20Platforms%20is%20headed%20for%20a%20high-stakes%20Q2%20earnings%20report%20on%20Wednesday.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EInvestors%20have%20become%20increasingly%20skittish%20about%20AI%20capex.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAnalysts%20are%20generally%20bullish%20ahead%20of%20Meta's%20report%2C%20but%20investors%20could%20balk%20at%20more%20big%20AI%20spending%20plans.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fmarkets.businessinsider.com%2Fstocks%2Fmeta-stock%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EMeta%20Platforms%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20heading%20into%20an%20earnings%20report%20with%20strong%20implications%20for%20the%20market's%20AI%20narrative.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20social%20media%20giant%2C%20which%20will%20report%20its%20latest%20results%20after%20the%20closing%20bell%20on%20Wednesday%2C%20is%20among%20the%20AI%20%26quot%3Bhyperscalers%26quot%3B%20spending%20hundreds%20of%20billions%20on%20the%20technology%2C%20and%20such%20lofty%20spending%20isn't%20being%20greeted%20with%20great%20enthusiasm%20by%20investors%20lately.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELast%20week%20delivered%20a%20preview%20of%20what%20could%20await%20Meta%20if%20it%20surprises%20investors%20with%20an%20outlook%20for%20even%20higher%20capex%20than%20expected.%20Both%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fbusinessinsider.com%2Ftesla-alphabet-stock-price-q2-earnings-capex-ai-spending-tsla-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EAlphabet%20and%20Tesla%20were%20punished%3C%2Fa%3E%20after%20they%20reported%20spending%20figures%20for%20the%20full%20year%20that%20outpaced%20Wall%20Street's%20estimates%2C%20with%20the%20stocks%20selling%20off%20after%20earnings.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWall%20Street's%20view%20of%20AI%20capex%20has%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhyperscalers-cant-win-with-investors-ai-spending-capex-alphabet-earnings-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eshifted%20dramatically%3C%2Fa%3E%20since%20last%20year.%20In%202025%2C%20companies%20couldn't%20spend%20enough%20on%20the%20technology%2C%20but%20the%20winds%20have%20shifted%20and%20investors%20are%20antsy%20to%20see%20a%20return%20on%20investment.%20With%20Meta%20stock%20down%20about%2010%25%20in%202026%2C%20investors%20are%20looking%20for%20a%20narrative-shifting%20report%20that%20could%20reinvigorate%20excitement%20around%20the%20social%20media%20company.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere%20is%20what%20top%20Wall%20Street%20firms%20are%20watching%20as%20Meta%20heads%20into%20its%20Q2%20earnings%20report.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22a454021b-a20e-4a60-a76f-53347ad2f8d8%5C%22%3EBank%20of%20America%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EBofA%20analysts%20maintain%20a%20Buy%20rating%20a%20bullish%20%24%20835%20price%20target%20on%20Meta%20stock%2C%20a%2040%25%20jump%20from%20Tuesday's%20price.%20The%20bank%20is%20forecasting%20an%20overall%20Q2%20beat%2C%20with%20analyst%20Justin%20Post%20citing%20its%20appealing%20valuation%20and%20significant%20AI%20benefits%20as%20the%20primary%20reasons%20why%20his%20team%20remains%20constructive%2C%20as%20well%20as%20healthy%20advertising%20growth.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20they%20expect%20Meta%20to%20keep%20raising%20AI%20spending%20figures%2C%20Post%20said%20high%20capex%20doesn't%20negatively%20impact%20his%20bullish%20thesis%20on%20the%20stock.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20do%20not%20expect%20AI%20infrastructure%20investment%20to%20slow%20near%20term%20given%20industry-wide%20compute%20capacity%20constraints%20and%20see%20potential%20for%20Meta%20to%20raise%20its%20FY26%20capex%20guidance%20to%20%24135-%24150bn%20(from%20%24125-%24145bn)%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote.%20%26quot%3BWe%20recently%20increased%20our%20FY26%20capex%20estimate%20to%20%24145bn%20and%20continue%20to%20see%20upside%20potential%20to%20Street%20estimates%20at%20%24136bn.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22752b00d9-928f-40da-9d54-aa4658ca5aa3%5C%22%3EGoldman%20Sachs%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EGoldman%20also%20expects%20Meta%20to%20continue%20ramping%20up%20AI%20capex%2C%20but%20it's%20not%20worried.%20According%20to%20analyst%20Eric%20Sheridan%2C%20Meta's%20spending%20will%20reach%20%24534%20billion%20from%202026%20to%202028%20as%20it%20continues%20to%20monetize%20its%20AI%20compute%20buildout.%20The%20bank%20has%20a%20Buy%20rating%20on%20the%20stock%20and%20a%20bullish%20%24815%20price%20target%2C%20a%2037%25%20jump%20from%20current%20levels.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20continue%20to%20see%20sustained%20operating%20momentum%20in%20terms%20of%20our%20advertising%20checks%20across%20Q2%2C%20which%20bodes%20well%20for%20its%20forward%20growth%20trajectory%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote.%20%26quot%3BWe%20continue%20to%20see%20the%20application%20of%20additional%20compute%20to%20the%20company's%20core%20Family%20of%20Apps%20products%20as%20generally%20underappreciated%20by%20investors.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2293934ee3-05d5-401f-9a1f-449edcf94c5d%5C%22%3EDeutsche%20Bank%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EDeutsche%20analyst%20Benjamin%20Black%20recently%20wrote%20that%20Meta%20should%20be%20doing%20more%20to%20scale%20it%20AI%20ambitions%2C%20rating%20the%20stock%20as%20a%20Buy%20and%20setting%20an%20%24800%20price%20target.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBlack%20did%20not%20give%20a%20specific%20capex%20forecast%2C%20though%20he%20wrote%20that%20spending%20will%20likely%20remain%20elevated.%20But%20similar%20to%20Goldman%2C%20he%20highlighted%20strong%20advertising%20growth%20and%20a%20promising%20AI%20monetization%20path%20as%20reasons%20to%20remain%20bullish%20on%20Meta.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIn%20our%20view%2C%20Meta's%20shares'%20modest%20discount%20to%20the%20broader%20market%20does%20not%20adequately%20reflect%20the%20durability%20of%20the%20advertising%20business%20or%20the%20growing%20monetization%20optionality%20across%20AI%2C%20subscriptions%2C%20business%20agents%2C%20and%20cloud%20infrastructure%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2235e6d427-e47b-4e60-adf5-1f47c370dcf9%5C%22%3ERBC%20Capital%20Markets%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3ERBC%20sees%20Meta%20as%20the%20tech%20stock%20with%20the%20biggest%20opportunity%20for%20investor%20sentiment%20to%20improve.%20Analyst%20Brad%20Erickson%20maintains%20an%20Outperform%20rating%20and%20a%20%24810%20price%20target.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EErickson%20added%20that%20if%20management%20increases%202026%20capex%20to%20the%20forecasted%20%24215%20billion%2C%20it%20would%20likely%20help%20position%20Meta%20as%20a%20competitive%20force%20in%20cloud%20infrastructure.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20degree%20to%20which%20management%20articulates%20a%20clear%20path%20to%20commercialization%E2%80%94and%20demonstrates%20early%20traction%20or%20proof%20points%E2%80%94will%20be%20critical%20in%20validating%20the%20enormous%20capex%20investments%20being%20made%20and%20could%20help%20address%20lingering%20concerns%20about%20return%20on%20invested%20capital%20in%20the%20AI%20era%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20noted.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22063891b8-6b7e-45ab-a50c-fd8ea15185fc%5C%22%3ENeedham%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3ENeedham%20is%20less%20bullish%2C%20maintaining%20a%20Hold%20rating%20and%20a%20more%20muted%20%24606%20price%20target%2C%20about%202%25%20higher%20than%20current%20levels.%20Analyst%20Laura%20Martin%20stated%20that%20her%20team%20favors%20waiting%20to%20purchase%20Meta%20stock%20until%20the%20current%20capex%20cycle%20is%20over%2C%20citing%20concerns%20about%20its%20plans%20for%20growth.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20retain%20our%20HOLD%2C%20because%20we%20believe%20that%20META's%20st