20is%20not%20the%20first%20big%20company%20run%20by%20an%20AI%20CEO%2C%26quot%3B%20Altman%20said%20at%20the%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%20data-script%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20data-styles%3D%5C%22default-width%5C%22%20data-embed-type%3D%5C%22youtube%5C%22%20data-type%3D%5C%22embed%5C%22%3E%3Ciframe%20referrerpolicy%3D%5C%22strict-origin-when-cross-origin%5C%22%20allowfullscreen%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fembed%2FXDB5beon4DY%3Ffeature%3Doembed%5C%22%20width%3D%5C%22560%5C%22%20title%3D%5C%22Sam%20Altman%20on%20AGI%2C%20Compute%2C%20and%20Human%20Agency%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22315%5C%22%3E%3C%2Fiframe%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20OpenAI%20CEO%20said%20that%20the%20focus%20on%20humanity%20is%20one%20of%20the%20reasons%20that%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-job-impact-losses-shifting-sam-altman-mustafa-suleyman-comments-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAI%20hasn't%20%26quot%3Bupended%26quot%3B%20the%20economy%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20the%20extent%20he%20originally%20expected.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BPeople%20have%20a%20great%20degree%20of%20trust%20and%20enjoyment%20in%20working%20with%20other%20people%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said%20on%20%26quot%3BInvest%20Like%20The%20Best.%26quot%3B%20%26quot%3BAnd%20you%20can%20go%20hire%20an%20AI%20consultant%20right%20now%2C%20or%20talk%20to%20an%20AI%20sales%20rep%20right%20now%2C%20or%20hire%20an%20AI%20engineer%20or%20whatever%20%E2%80%94%20somehow%20most%20people%20seem%20to%20still%20really%20prefer%20interacting%20with%20a%20human.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAltman%20said%20he%20feels%20the%20same%20way%2C%20too.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20definitely%20would%20much%20rather%20engage%20with%20a%20person%20than%20engage%20with%20an%20AI%20for%20almost%20everything%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20an%20example%2C%20Altman%20said%20that%20even%20though%20AI%20models%20can%20create%20spectacular%20images%2C%20people%20still%20value%20human-made%20artwork.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThere's%20the%20joke%20about%20at%20this%20point%2C%20the%20signature%20on%20a%20piece%20of%20art%20is%20most%20of%20the%20value%2C%20but%20the%20truth%20of%20it%20is%20you%20want%20to%20know%20about%20the%20person%20behind%20it%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%20%26quot%3BYou%20read%20a%20novel%2C%20you%20want%20to%20know%20about%20the%20person%20behind%20it.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAltman%20said%20this%20focus%20on%20preserving%20and%20valuing%20humanity%20is%20one%20of%20the%20reasons%20that%20he%20has%20shifted%20his%20views%20on%20whether%20the%20technology%20will%20lead%20to%20mass%20job%20displacement%20like%20the%20kind%20he%20previously%20theorized.%20He%20recently%20said%20that%20he%20was%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsam-altman-ai-jobs-prediction-wrong-white-collar-openai-australia-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%26quot%3Bdelighted%20to%20be%20wrong%26quot%3B%20about%20the%20short-term%20impact%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20entry-level%20jobs%20after%20previously%20stating%20that%20AI%20would%20wipe%20out%20%26quot%3Bentire%20classes%26quot%3B%20of%20jobs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20debate%20between%20AI-created%20and%20human-created%20content%20is%20roiling%20everything%20from%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Finstagram-chief-says-ai-will-make-human-creators-more-valuable-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EInstagram%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20the%20books%20on%20the%20shelves%20at%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-written-books-might-coming-to-your-barnes-and-noble-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EBarnes%20%26amp%3B%20Noble.%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELike%20Altman%2C%20others%20in%20the%20industry%20have%20said%20that%20they%20are%20putting%20an%20emphasis%20on%20human%20taste%20or%20judgment.%20Altman%20suggested%20that%20%26quot%3Btaste%26quot%3B%20might%20not%20be%20the%20best%20word%20to%20capture%20what%20humans%20do%20better%20than%20AI%2C%20even%20as%20he%20exp