nsider.com%2Fwho-is-bernard-arnault-richest-person-in-europe-lvmh-life-photos-2019-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ELVMH's%20billionaire%20CEO%3C%2Fa%3E%20discussed%20the%20bet%20during%20a%20rare%20interview%20on%20the%20%26quot%3BLegend%26quot%3B%20podcast%2C%20aired%20earlier%20this%20month.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESpeaking%20in%20French%2C%20Arnault%20told%20host%20Guillaume%20Pley%20his%20family%20office%20acquired%20%26quot%3Bnearly%2020%25%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnetflix-history-streaming-growth-story-hollywood-disruption-subscribers-2022-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ENetflix%3C%2Fa%3E%26quot%3B%20shortly%20after%20its%20launch%2C%20and%20the%20wager%20proved%20to%20be%20a%20%26quot%3Bhuge%20success.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20Arnault%20%E2%80%94%20whose%20company%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flvmh-brands-iconic-luxury-goods-bernard-arnault-2019-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eowns%20dozens%20of%20luxury%20brands%3C%2Fa%3E%20including%20Louis%20Vuitton%2C%20Mo%C3%ABt%20%26amp%3B%20Chandon%2C%20Sephora%2C%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftiffany-co-lvmh-crown-jewel-earnings-report-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ETiffany%20%26amp%3B%20Co%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20said%20he%20%26quot%3Bsold%20too%20soon%26quot%3B%20as%20Netflix%20stock%20has%20%26quot%3Bmultiplied%20tenfold%26quot%3B%20since%20his%20exit.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EGroupe%20Arnault%20invested%20%2430%20million%20in%20Netflix%20in%20July%201999%2C%20becoming%20its%20largest%20investor%20about%20two%20years%20after%20its%20founding%2C%20according%20to%20news%20reports%20from%20that%20period.%20At%20the%20time%2C%20Netflix%20was%20still%20privately%20owned%20and%20in%20the%20business%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnetflix-mail-service-sending-last-shipment-10-mystery-dvds-2023-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Emailing%20rented%20DVDs%20to%20customers%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20Arnault's%20team%20sold%20much%20of%20the%20position%20by%20the%20summer%20of%202003%2C%20when%20Netflix's%20market%20capitalization%20was%20about%20%24500%20million%20%E2%80%94%20roughly%201%2F600%20of%20the%20video-streaming%20giant's%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnetflix-second-quarter-earnings-engagement-report-short-form-video-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecurrent%20value%3C%2Fa%3E%20of%20around%20%24300%20billion.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIgnoring%20dilution%20and%20any%20other%20factors%2C%20a%2020%25%20stake%20in%20Netflix%20would%20be%20worth%20about%20%2460%20billion%20today%2C%20and%20would%20have%20been%20worth%20over%20%24110%20billion%20when%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbig-short-michael-burry-netflix-disney-media-stocks-streaming-content-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Estock%20peaked%20last%20summer%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EArnault%20also%20said%20during%20the%20podcast%20episode%20that%20he'd%20invested%20in%20a%20US%20fund%20that%20was%20liquidated%20during%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftech-bubble-nasdaq-correction-ai-2000-dot-com-bubble-crash-2025-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Edot-com%20crash%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20as%20a%20result%2C%20he%20received%20a%20%26quot%3Bbig%20batch%26quot%3B%20of%20Google%20shares%20when%20they%20were%20trading%20for%20around%20%242%20to%20%243%20each.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20didn't%20know%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgoogle%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EGoogle%3C%2Fa%3E%20back%20then%2C%26quot%3B%20Arnault%20said.%20%26quot%3BWe%20sold%20them%20somewhere%20along%20the%20line%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20continued%2C%20noting%20they%20%26quot%3Bmade%20a%20good%20profit.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EGoogle%2C%20now%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgoogle-alphabet%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAlphabet%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20has%20seen%20its%20market%20capitalization%20jump%20by%20more%20than%20130-fold%20since%20its%20public%20debut%20in%20August%202004%2C%20from%20below%20%2430%20billion%20to%20around%20%244%20trillion.%20The%20search-and-advertising%20titan%20has%20benefited%20from%20high%20hopes%20that%20it%20will%20be%20a%20dominant%20player%20in%20the%20AI%20era.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EArnault%20may%20have%20sold%20Netflix%20and%20Google%20stock%20at%20a%20tiny%20fraction%20of%20their%20current%20value%2C%20but%20he's%20still%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftech-bubble-nasdaq-correction-ai-2000-dot-com-bubble-crash-2025-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ethrived%20financially%3C%2Fa%3E.%20His%20estimated%20%24156%20billion%20fortune%20makes%20him%20the%20wealthiest%20non-American%20on%20the%20Bloomberg%20Billionaires%20Index%2C%20and%20richer%20than%20Warren%20Buffett.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flvmh-bernard-arnault-netflix-stock-investment-google-alphabet-tech-podcast-2026-7%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785253678000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a68c57b548c9c486b31153b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flvmh-bernard-arnault-netflix-stock-investment-google-alphabet-tech-podcast-2026-7%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22LVMH%20CEO%20Bernard%20Arnault%20said%20he%20acquired%20nearly%2020%25%20of%20Netflix%20early%20on%20but%20sold%20it%20prematurely%2C%20and%20it%20was%20a%20similar%20story%20with%20his%20Google%20shares.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22tmohamed%40businessinsider.com%20(Theron%20Mohamed)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A10%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Japan%20earthquake%3A%20What%20we%20know%20so%20far%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785253502000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A